('P2024-0000003', 'm-sand', 'M Sand', 'Simple', 'RPC BM6811', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', 'https://youtu.be/BVj9bh7I3Dk', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000003/982158cb646cc259da6380a9131910fc.pdf', '2517', 'PC2024-0000007', 'PSC2024-0000082', 'UOM2024-0000005', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2024-0000003', 3600, 3300, 'auto', '<ul>\n	<li>RPC&nbsp;&nbsp;M sand is produced by crushing the hard granite, a rock which helps to provide an aggregate construction material for clients. RPC-M Sand is manufacturing this product by introducing the world&lsquo;s best crusher technology - Vertical Shaft Impactor (VSI Technology)from Finland.</li>\n	<li>This Rock-on-Rock technology makes RPC&nbsp;&nbsp;M-sand more cubical which gives more strength and bonding when applied with allied building materials.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>1. VSI quality<br />\n2. Higher durability<br />\n3. Higher Concrete Strength<br />\n4. Zone &ndash; II (IS:383 Code Standard)<br />\n5. PWD Approved Quality<br />\n6. Less Water Absorption property<br />\n7. Lesser Slit Content<br />\n8. Economic for use<br />\n9. Eco-friendly product&nbsp;</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering M Sand to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000003/7XDm23zV8c_20240109140231.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:400;s:6:\"height\";i:400;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000003/7XDm23zV8c_20240109140231.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000003/7XDm23zV8c_20240109140231_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:200;s:6:\"height\";i:200;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000003/7XDm23zV8c_20240109140231_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:100;s:6:\"height\";i:100;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000003/7XDm23zV8c_20240109140231_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:40;s:6:\"height\";i:40;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000003/7XDm23zV8c_20240109140231_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-06 00:40:16', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 05:55:28', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000004', 'psand', 'P-Sand', 'Simple', 'RPC BM6812', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000002\";}', 'https://youtu.be/BVj9bh7I3Dk', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000004/a7b262a447823aecff9e034f8f590b60.pdf', '2517', 'PC2024-0000007', 'PSC2024-0000082', 'UOM2024-0000005', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2024-0000003', 4600, 4300, 'auto', '<p>1.VSI quality<br />\n2. PWD Approved quality<br />\n3.Zone-IV (IS:383 code Standard)<br />\n4. Free of Slit and Clay Particles<br />\n5. Higher unit weight<br />\n6. Lesser binder content required for plastering&nbsp;</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering P Sand to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000004/mabXCBgHBh_20240109140526.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000004/mabXCBgHBh_20240109140526.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:225;s:6:\"height\";i:225;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000004/mabXCBgHBh_20240109140526_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000004/mabXCBgHBh_20240109140526_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:75;s:6:\"height\";i:75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000004/mabXCBgHBh_20240109140526_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:30;s:6:\"height\";i:30;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000004/mabXCBgHBh_20240109140526_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-06 01:18:18', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 05:59:19', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000005', 'river-sand', 'River Sand', 'Simple', 'RPC RS6820', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', 'https://youtu.be/BVj9bh7I3Dk', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000005/c9a804a2742f67fbea30359b4a78b224.pdf', '2505', 'PC2024-0000007', 'PSC2024-0000082', 'UOM2024-0000005', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2024-0000003', 12000, 11500, 'auto', '<p>River sand is a natural type of sand formed through weathering or erosion processes, distinguishing it from sands produced by crushing rock. It tends to vary in gradation but generally exhibits a coarse texture.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering River Sand to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000005/vLwhNHAN6H_20240703145512.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:600;s:6:\"height\";i:600;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000005/vLwhNHAN6H_20240703145512.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:450;s:6:\"height\";d:450;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000005/vLwhNHAN6H_20240703145512_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:300;s:6:\"height\";d:300;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000005/vLwhNHAN6H_20240703145512_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:150;s:6:\"height\";d:150;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000005/vLwhNHAN6H_20240703145512_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-06 01:29:28', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 06:31:03', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000006', 'boulders-rough-stone', 'Boulders Rough Stone', 'Simple', 'RPC BM6818', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000002\";}', 'https://youtu.be/BVj9bh7I3Dk', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000006/a711a63ce111d59357fa2c8ba6a9757e.pdf', '2517', 'PC2024-0000007', 'PSC2024-0000082', 'UOM2024-0000005', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2024-0000003', 2200, 2200, 'auto', '<p>A boulder, essentially a large rock, is often considered more technically by scientists. They use this term not merely for a big rock, but specifically to denote a rock that has been displaced from its original location by natural forces like rivers or glaciers.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process.</p>\n\n<p>We are engaged in offering Boulder Crushed Stone to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000006/vFkbs7rv6v_20240715161959.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:360;s:6:\"height\";i:360;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000006/vFkbs7rv6v_20240715161959.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:270;s:6:\"height\";d:270;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000006/vFkbs7rv6v_20240715161959_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:180;s:6:\"height\";d:180;