('P2024-0000018', 'quartz-stone', 'Quartz Stone', 'Simple', 'RPCQS6834', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', NULL, NULL, '2506', 'PC2024-0000007', 'PSC2425-0000011', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2024-0000003', 500, 500, 'auto', '<p>Our Quartz Sand, renowned for its unique gradation and quality standards, is widely utilized in epoxy grouting solutions and tile adhesive filling, meeting international standards. RPC Supplied this materials with 1st class quality.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Quartz Stone to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000018/gRePEuGlF2_20240109154130.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:340;s:6:\"height\";i:340;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000018/gRePEuGlF2_20240109154130.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:255;s:6:\"height\";i:255;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000018/gRePEuGlF2_20240109154130_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:170;s:6:\"height\";i:170;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000018/gRePEuGlF2_20240109154130_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:85;s:6:\"height\";i:85;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploa