('P2024-0000020', 'shuttering-mate', 'Shuttering Mate', 'Simple', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC2024-0000010', 'PSC2024-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000002', 1000, 1000, 'auto', '<p>DURA Shuttering Mate, a closed-cell polymer-based material, serves as a shuttering agent for concrete curing. Its design prevents slurry from flowing off, facilitating improved concrete curing and enhancing its strength. &nbsp;RPC Supplied this materials with 1st class quality.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of&nbsp;manufacturing and wholesaling trading&nbsp;of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering&nbsp; Shuttering Material to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', '', 'a:0:{}', 'Active', 1, '2024-01-06 06:37:53', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, '2024-01-09 00:46:19', 'U2023-0000002'),
('P2024-0000021', 'glass-fibre', 'Glass Fibre', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000021/7ba318e75b129863563dd0400040ec4b.pdf', '7019', 'PC2024-0000010', 'PSC2024-0000020', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000002', 1000, 1000, 'auto', '<p>Glass fiber, composed of numerous fine strands of glass, stands out as one of the most versatile industrial materials recognized today, boasting mechanical properties on par with other fibers like carbon fiber and polymers. RPC Supplied this materials with 1st class quality.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of&nbsp;manufacturing and wholesaling trading&nbsp;of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering&nbsp;&nbsp;Glass Fibre to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000021/VwQKygk0Nx_20240109151044.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:420;s:6:\"height\";i:420;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000021/VwQKygk0Nx_20240109151044.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:315;s:6:\"height\";i:315;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000021/VwQKygk0Nx_20240109151044_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:210;s:6:\"height\";i:210;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/prod