('P2024-0000026', 'fly-ash-bricks', 'Fly Ash Bricks', 'Simple', 'RPC BR6840', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000002\";}', NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000026/274b32c009fa8b7b4da293c7c867a41f.pdf', '6901', 'PC2024-0000006', 'PSC2024-0000083', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000001', 7, 7, 'auto', '<p><strong>Fly Ash Bricks</strong>-Due to prosperous industry practice, RPC are involved in providing a broad range of Fly Ash Brick.&nbsp; This range is enormously employed owing to their reasonable rates and strong nature.</p>\n\n<p>Size: 9x4x3 inches</p>\n\n<p>We are the leading manufacturer and supplier of an innovative range of Fly Ash Brick. We make these fly ash bricks in various specifications to the clients so that their specific demands are fulfilled. These fly ash bricks are well tested on well-defined parameters of quality by our professionals before they are delivered to our customers. These bricks are manufactured using finest quality fly ash and latest manufacturing technology under the strict guidance of our professionals.</p>\n\n<p>Features:</p>\n\n<p>Good appearance<br />\nStructural Capability<br />\nHigh compressive strength<br />\nLess water absorption<br />\nEco Friendly<br />\nAccuracy in dimension<br />\nSound Insulation<br />\nFire resistance.<br />\nDurability and moisture resistance<br />\nSustainability<br />\nReplacement of Clay bricks<br />\nGreen product<br />\n&nbsp;</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Flyash Bricks to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:2:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000012\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000013\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000026/5lvbgdyHkX_20240109110240.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:192;s:6:\"height\";i:192;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000026/5lvbgdyHkX_20240109110240.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:144;s:6:\"height\";i:144;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000026/5lvbgdyHkX_20240109110240_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:96;s:6:\"height\";i:96;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000026/5lvbgdyHkX_20240109110240_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:48;s:6:\"height\";i:48;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000026/5lvbgdyHkX_20240109110240_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:19.2;s:6:\"height\";d:19.2;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000026/5lvbgdyHkX_20240109110240_10.png\";}}', 'Inactive', 0, '2024-01-08 04:37:07', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 05:24:37', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000027', 'exposed-rough-bricks', 'Exposed Rough Bricks', 'Simple', 'RPC BR6842', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000027/404c36181036cd7a358ace883426e9dd.pdf', '6901', 'PC2024-0000006', 'PSC2024-0000083', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000001', 10, 10, 'auto', '<p>The most beautiful example of human inventions, the traditional hand thrown brick. We are manufacturing Crown Red Orange Brick. Every brick made by this method is unique in texture and color as the shaping process involves throwing the clot of clay in a mold box flushed with fine sand, every clot of clay that strikes the mold does so in a slightly different way which leads to a different texture for every brick. The particle size of the sand also leads to many different textures, the difference of humidity in the clay clots leads to different textures, a dynamic combination of all this leads to a product that is random, beautiful yet amazingly strong, crisp in shape and can be used to create structures for generations to come.</p>\n\n<p>Features</p>\n\n<p>Durability.<br />\nThermal performance.<br />\nFire resistance.<br />\nHealth and wellbeing.<br />\nDesign flexibility.<br />\nHandcrafted aesthetics.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Exposed Bricks to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:2:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000012\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000013\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000027/mgvJbYP7f7_20240731172915.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:527;s:6:\"height\";i:527;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000027/mgvJbYP7f7_20240731172915.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:395.25;s:6:\"height\";d:395.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000027/mgvJbYP7f7_20240731172915_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:263.5;s:6:\"height\";d:263.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000027/mgvJbYP7f7_20240731172915_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:131.75;s:6:\"height\";d:131.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000027/mgvJbYP7f7_20240731172915_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-08 04:43:13', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 05:27:55', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000028', 'wirecut-bricks-943', 'Wirecut Bricks (9*4*3)', 'Simple', 'RPC BR6841', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000028/ab1b40931a86f9d24ea34c8123794302.pdf', '6901', 'PC2024-0000006', 'PSC2024-0000083', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000001', 15, 15, 'auto', '<p>Clay Wirecut bricks are burned in a running chambers/kiln which makes them durable. The composition of clay varies over a wide range. Usually, clays are composed mainly of Silica (grains of sand), Alumina, Lime, Iron, Manganese, Sulphur, and Phosphates, in different proportions.&nbsp;<br />\nWire cut bricks are made using machineries in factory whereas table mould bricks are made by hand and hence wire cut bricks will have uniform properties, higher strength and regular surfaces compared to table mould bricks however little costlier than table mould bricks.<br />\nFeatures</p>\n\n<p>Good appearance<br />\nStructural Capability<br />\nHigh compressive strength<br />\nLess water absorption<br />\nAccuracy in dimension<br />\nSound Insulation<br />\nFire resistance.<br />\nDurability and moisture resistance<br />\nSustainability<br />\n&nbsp;</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Wirecut Bricks to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:2:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000012\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000013\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000028/GJTHWDLNHw_20240109144232.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:729;s:6:\"height\";i:729;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000028/GJTHWDLNHw_20240109144232.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:546.75;s:6:\"height\";d:546.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000028/GJTHWDLNHw_20240109144232_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:364.5;s:6:\"height\";d:364.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000028/GJTHWDLNHw_20240109144232_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:182.25;s:6:\"height\";d:182.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000028/GJTHWDLNHw_20240109144232_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:72.9;s:6:\"height\";d:72.9;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000028/GJTHWDLNHw_20240109144232_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-08 04:50:00', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 05:27:15', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000029', 'porotherm-bricks', 'Porotherm Bricks', 'Simple', 'RPC BR6844 / RPC BR6845 / RPC BR6846', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', NULL, NULL, '6901', 'PC2024-0000006', 'PSC2024-0000083', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000001', 12, 12, 'auto', '<p>Porotherm clay bricks are horizontally or vertically perforated clay bricks are manufactured in variety of sizes and the term Porotherm is used due to its desired thermal insulation characteristics.</p>\n\n<p>The perforation of the clay brick provides an exception walling system which facilitates thermal insulation resulting in cooler interiors in hot seasons and warm interior conditions in cold seasons.</p>\n\n<p>The porotherm clay bricks are easy to use, economical, environmentally friendly, and it can be used for the construction of both non-load bearing walls and load bearing walls.</p>\n\n<p>Porotherm Clay Blocks are light in weight, energy efficient, fire and sound proof, easy to install, eco-friendly, recyclable product, higher strength to weight ratio, seismic resistance, precision breakages product and used for non-load bearing partition walls.</p>\n\n<p>Properties of Porotherm Bricks<br />\nThe compressive strength is greater than 3.5MPa<br />\nHigh thermal and sound insulation.<br />\nLow weight.</p>\n\n<p>High fire resistance<br />\nDensity range from 694 to 783 kg/m3<br />\nLarge in size but light in weight results in low dead load<br />\nWater absorption is around 15%</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Porotherm Bricks to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000029/pSVz5vdngl_20240109153632.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:242;s:6:\"height\";i:242;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000029/pSVz5vdngl_20240109153632.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:181.5;s:6:\"height\";d:181.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000029/pSVz5vdngl_20240109153632_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:121;s:6:\"height\";i:121;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000029/pSVz5vdngl_20240109153632_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:60.5;s:6:\"height\";d:60.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000029/pSVz5vdngl_20240109153632_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:24.2;s:6:\"height\";d:24.2;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000029/pSVz5vdngl_20240109153632_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-08 05:05:19', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 05:47:04', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000030', 'interlock-bricks', 'Interlock Bricks', 'Simple', 'RPC BR6850 / RPC BR6851 / RPC BR6852', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000030/fcc00a5e80b37c40d3bc1c54951883f0.pdf', '6901', 'PC2024-0000006', 'PSC2024-0000083', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000001', 12, 12, 'auto', '<p>Interlocking bricks are the enhanced form of conventional clay bricks. Each brick is constructively designed to lock itself to the other bricks around without the use of mortar. The self-locking is achieved using shear-key and lock mechanism. These bricks add strength and durability to any building they are used in. &nbsp;These are available in a variety of colors and shapes.</p>\n\n<p>Features</p>\n\n<p>Durability.<br />\nThermal performance.<br />\nFire resistance.<br />\nHealth and wellbeing.<br />\nDesign flexibility.<br />\nHandcrafted aesthetics.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Interlock Bricks to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:2:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000012\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000013\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000030/w227t1T07z_20240109135437.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:359;s:6:\"height\";i:359;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000030/w227t1T07z_20240109135437.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:269.25;s:6:\"height\";d:269.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000030/w227t1T07z_20240109135437_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:179.5;s:6:\"height\";d:179.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000030/w227t1T07z_20240109135437_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:89.75;s:6:\"height\";d:89.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000030/w227t1T07z_20240109135437_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:35.9;s:6:\"height\";d:35.9;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000030/w227t1T07z_20240109135437_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-08 05:20:14', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 06:03:32', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000031', 'hollow-blocks', 'Hollow Blocks', 'Simple', 'RPC BR6853', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', NULL, NULL, '6801', 'PC2024-0000006', 'PSC2024-0000084', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000001', 32, 32, 'auto', '<p>Hollow blocks can be used like any other masonry unit to build foundations, walls, arches and corbels, etc. A typical hollow block is equivalent to 4.5 bricks, thus construction is faster than with other masonry units. The mortar used is also, less which results in cost saving.</p>\n\n<p>Our entire range of hallow bricks are made of latest concrete compact technology with higher compressive strength &amp; low water absorption. We ensure that the formulation of our hollow bricks is done using quality raw material that ensures its good performance.</p>\n\n<p>Why hollow blocks?</p>\n\n<p>It reduces to 60% in cement mortar consumption. It is cheap having its high value. It reduces cost of construction. Natural thermal insulation. Superior compression strength. Light weight (up to 40% reduction in dead load).</p>\n\n<p>Environment friendly. Additionally, Hollow Blocks are lightweight (up to 40% reduction in dead load) &amp; provides natural thermal insulation. 30% reduction in plastering cost.</p>\n\n<p>We are provide 12&quot; 8&quot; 6&quot;, 15&quot; 8&quot; 4&quot;, 15&quot; 8&quot; 6&quot; Type of blocks</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hollow blocks</strong>&nbsp;are more useful due to its lightweight and ease of ventilation.<br />\nThe&nbsp;<strong>blocks</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>bricks</strong>&nbsp;are made out of mixture of cement, sand and stone<br />\nchips&nbsp;<strong>Hollowblocks</strong>&nbsp;construction provides facilities for concealing electrical conduit, water and soil pipes</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Hollow Blocks to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:1:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000009\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000031/KMrU0ZEHUC_20240109135751.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:639;s:6:\"height\";i:639;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000031/KMrU0ZEHUC_20240109135751.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:479.25;s:6:\"height\";d:479.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000031/KMrU0ZEHUC_20240109135751_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:319.5;s:6:\"height\";d:319.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000031/KMrU0ZEHUC_20240109135751_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:159.75;s:6:\"height\";d:159.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000031/KMrU0ZEHUC_20240109135751_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:63.9;s:6:\"height\";d:63.9;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000031/KMrU0ZEHUC_20240109135751_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-08 06:00:50', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 06:05:21', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000032', 'solid-blocks-4', 'Solid Blocks 4', 'Simple', 'RPC BR6856', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000032/b21b2b73876abb7b0d1eb6d0eb495801.pdf', '6901', 'PC2024-0000006', 'PSC2024-0000083', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000001', 32, 32, 'auto', '<p>We are a most trusted name among the topmost companies in this business, involved in offering Rectangular AAC Block with high quality product.They are most durable and a good insulator. These bricks have high compressive strength and available in different sizes which are used in construction industry. These blocks find wide applicability and construction cost is largely reduced.</p>\n\n<p>It reduces to 60% in cement mortar consumption. It is cheap having its high value. It reduces cost of construction. Natural thermal insulation. Superior compression strength. Light weight (up to 40% reduction in dead load).</p>\n\n<p>Environment friendly. Additionally, Solid Blocks are lightweight (up to 40% reduction in dead load) &amp; provides natural thermal insulation. 30% reduction in plastering cost.</p>\n\n<p>We are provide 12&quot; 8&quot; 6&quot;, 15&quot; 8&quot; 4&quot;, 15&quot; 8&quot; 6&quot; Type of blocks</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at a