('P2024-0000048', 'ultratech-weather-plus-cement-50kg', 'Ultratech Weather Plus Cement 50kg', 'Simple', 'RPC CU6878', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', 'https://youtube.com/shorts/Lz8ljTvDrf4?si=bLq-M4xJN8Q1Xycx', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000048/c214c0de1e082ce7970f9a54206556ac.pdf', '2523', 'PC2023-0000001', 'PSC2024-0000035', 'UOM2023-0000003', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2024-0000004', 480, 420, 'auto', '<p>UltraTech Weather Plus cement acts as a water-repellent solution, effectively preventing water infiltration and offering superior protection against dampness, thus ensuring the structural integrity of your home remains safeguarded.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Ultratech weather Plus Cement to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:3:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000005\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000004\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000006\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000048/aF82UQYsZ2_20240210150355.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1281;s:6:\"height\";i:1281;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000048/aF82UQYsZ2_20240210150355.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:960.75;s:6:\"height\";d:960.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000048/aF82UQYsZ2_20240210150355_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:640.5;s:6:\"height\";d:640.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000048/aF82UQYsZ2_20240210150355_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:320.25;s:6:\"height\";d:320.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000048/aF82UQYsZ2_20240210150355_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:128.1;s:6:\"height\";d:128.1;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000048/aF82UQYsZ2_20240210150355_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-10 01:13:47', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-29 07:08:13', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000049', 'ultratech-super-cement-50kg', 'Ultratech Super Cement 50kg', 'Simple', 'RPC CU6879', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', 'https://youtube.com/shorts/Lz8ljTvDrf4?si=bLq-M4xJN8Q1Xycx', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000049/de99f9429e9fdc390084fa1f2d8fb8d2.pdf', '2523', 'PC2023-0000001', 'PSC2024-0000035', 'UOM2023-0000003', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2024-0000004', 530, 500, 'auto', '<p>It is a finely blended cement manufactured using latest technology. It produces high strength concrete which is durable and highly resistant to wet cracking and thermal cracking. Ultratech Super cement has high degree of cohesion and workability in concrete and mortar. This blended cement is suitable for residential complexes, apartments, dams, flyovers, airports, bridges, railways and other commercial and residential structures.<br />\nThe concrete produced by using PPC cement has high ultimate strength, is more durable, resists wet cracking, thermal cracking and has a high degree of cohesion and workability in concrete and mortar.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Ultratech Super Cement&nbsp; to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:3:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000005\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000006\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000004\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000049/Yw7pSZjYuB_20240210145626.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:217;s:6:\"height\";i:217;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000049/Yw7pSZjYuB_20240210145626.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:162.75;s:6:\"height\";d:162.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000049/Yw7pSZjYuB_20240210145626_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:108.5;s:6:\"height\";d:108.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000049/Yw7pSZjYuB_20240210145626_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:54.25;s:6:\"height\";d:54.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000049/Yw7pSZjYuB_20240210145626_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:21.7;s:6:\"height\";d:21.7;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000049/Yw7pSZjYuB_20240210145626_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-10 01:15:48', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-22 06:26:30', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
