:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000004\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000063/e3pRdLm3Xx_20240913104458.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:515;s:6:\"height\";i:515;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000063/e3pRdLm3Xx_20240913104458.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:386.25;s:6:\"height\";d:386.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000063/e3pRdLm3Xx_20240913104458_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:257.5;s:6:\"height\";d:257.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000063/e3pRdLm3Xx_20240913104458_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:128.75;s:6:\"height\";d:128.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000063/e3pRdLm3Xx_20240913104458_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-10 22:55:18', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-11-26 05:45:38', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000064', 'chetinad-composite-cement-50kg', 'Chetinad Composite Cement 50kg', 'Simple', 'RPC CC6893', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', 'https://youtube.com/shorts/Lz8ljTvDrf4?si=bLq-M4xJN8Q1Xycx', '', '2523', 'PC2023-0000001', 'PSC2024-0000080', 'UOM2023-0000003', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2024-0000004', 530, 480, 'auto', '<p>Chettinad Cement Composite combines the characteristics of PPC and PSC cement, providing distinct advantages such as enhanced concrete workability with superior slump retention. It facilitates repeated silica reactions, fostering the formation of Calcium Silica Hydrate Gel, thereby enhancing the strength and density of concrete.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Chettinad Composite cement to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:3:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000004\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000005\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"AT2024-0000006\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000064/7v8L2sHldR_20240125171250.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:180;s:6:\"height\";i:180;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000064/7v8L2sHldR_20240125171250.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:135;s:6:\"height\";i:135;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000064/7v8L2sHldR_20240125171250_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:90;s:6:\"height\";i:90;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000064/7v8L2sHldR_20240125171250_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:45;s:6:\"height\";i:45;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000064/7v8L2sHldR_20240125171250_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:18;s:6:\"height\";i:18;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000064/7v8L2sHldR_20240125171250_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-10 22:57:17', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-27 09:44:57', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL);
