('P2024-0000120', 'a-star-opc-cement-50kg', 'A Star OPC Cement 50kg', 'Simple', 'RPC CAS7047', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000001\";}', 'https://youtube.com/shorts/Lz8ljTvDrf4?si=bLq-M4xJN8Q1Xycx', '', '2523', 'PC2023-0000001', 'PSC2024-0000054', 'UOM2023-0000003', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Exclude', 'TX2024-0000004', 500, 410, 'auto', '<p>Ordinary Portland Cement (OPC) 53 is a higher strength cement to meet the varied needs of the customer segments, prov iding higher concrete strength and durability. As per BIS requirements, the minimum 28 days compressive strength of 53 Grade Ordinary Portland Cement (OPC) should not be less than 53 MPa. For specialized construction works, such as pre-stressed concrete and certain items of precast concrete that consistently requires high strength concrete, the use of 53-grade Ordinary Portland Cement (OPC) is found to be very useful. 53-grade Ordinary Portland Cement (OPC) ensures higher-grade concrete at very economical cement content. 53 Grade Ordinary Portland Cement (OPC) can be used for the following applications.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering <strong>A Star OPC Cement</strong> to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/pr