ducts is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000190/bpcb9QN26i_20240120120725.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:337;s:6:\"height\";i:337;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000190/bpcb9QN26i_20240120120725.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:252.75;s:6:\"height\";d:252.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000190/bpcb9QN26i_20240120120725_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:168.5;s:6:\"height\";d:168.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000190/bpcb9QN26i_20240120120725_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:84.25;s:6:\"height\";d:84.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000190/bpcb9QN26i_20240120120725_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:33.7000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:6:\"height\";d:33.7000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000190/bpcb9QN26i_20240120120725_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-20 01:10:31', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
