('P2024-0000192', 'nitobond-ep-4l', 'NITOBOND EP (4L)', 'Simple', 'CS NA NEP 004', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000002\";}', NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000192/d959f95564a209815884a087e721fd07.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 5000, 4800, 'auto', '<p>Nitobond EP is based on solvent free epoxy resins containing pigments and fi ne fi llers. It is supplied as a two part material in preweighed quantities for ready onsite mixing and use. Coloured components - white base and green hardener - provide visual evidence that adequate mixing is achieved.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> More overlay time : Enables to place the concrete for longer period of time, without risk of delamination  High bond strength : Bond strength is more than the tensile strength of good quality concrete  Barrier coat : Acts as a &lsquo;barrier coat&rsquo; to the migration of chloride ions from host concrete.  Can be applied on to dry or damp substrates</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering NITOBOND EP (4L) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000192/FWxI0phnP8_20240120124438.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:483;s:6:\"height\";i:483;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000192/FWxI0phnP8_20240120124438.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:362.25;s:6:\"height\";d:362.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000192/FWxI0phnP8_20240120124438_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:241.5;s:6:\"height\";d:241.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000192/FWxI0phnP8_20240120124438_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:120.75;s:6:\"height\";d:120.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000192/FWxI0phnP8_20240120124438_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:48.2999999999999971578290569595992565155029296875;s:6:\"height\";d:48.2999999999999971578290569595992565155029296875;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000192/FWxI0phnP8_20240120124438_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-20 01:46:08', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-07-16 04:32:54', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000193', 'nitozinc-primer-1lit', 'Nitozinc Primer 1lit', 'Simple', 'CS NA NP 028', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000193/8bca6e351a605355c75378f9d421f40c.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 1950, 1750, 'auto', '<p>Nitozinc Primer is supplied as a two component system based on metallic zinc and epoxy resin which on mixing gives a grey coloured liquid.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Anti corrosive - Active &#39;Zinc-rich&#39; system combats corrosion by electro chemical means.  Two component product - Easy to mix and use.  Timesaving - Touch dry after 30 to 45 mins.  Excellent adhesion - Exhibits excellent bond strength in cementitious repairs.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Nitozinc Primer 1lit to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000193/fpaM7NuUTM_20240120125008.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:792;s:6:\"height\";i:792;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000193/fpaM7NuUTM_20240120125008.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:594;s:6:\"height\";d:594;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/produc