('P2024-0000197', 'cebex-100-225gms', 'CEBEX 100 -225GMS', 'Simple', 'CS NA CEB 007', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000197/54c179ac739c2de8354ff8ee1e60b261.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000018', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 100, 80, 'auto', '<p>Cebex 100, a plasticised expanding grout admixture is supplied as a powder. The material is a combination of a plasticising agent and a gas producing expansion medium. The plastisicing agent allows the use of a reduced water/cement ratio with consequent increased strengths and durability. The expansive medium counteracts the natural settlement and plastic shrinkage of the grout and aids stability and cohesion</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Gaseous expansion system compensates for plastic shrinkage and settlement in properly designed cementitious grout.  Reduced water/cement ratio mixes in the grout mix ensures low permeability and long term durability in service.  Gives grout high fl uidity with low water/cement ratio, thus making placement or injection of the grout easy.  No metallic iron content to corrode and cause staining or deterioration due to rust expansion in the grout.  Composition allows high early strength development in grouts, without the use of chlorides.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering CEBEX 100 -225GMS to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000197/yK4an0TsKb_20240122120730.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:524;s:6:\"height\";i:524;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000197/yK4an0TsKb_20240122120730.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:393;s:6:\"height\";d:393;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000197/yK4an0TsKb_20240122120730_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:262;s:6:\"height\";d:262;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000197/yK4an0TsKb_20240122120730_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:131;s:6:\"height\";d:131;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000197/yK4an0TsKb_20240122120730_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:52.39999999999999857891452847979962825775146484375;s:6:\"height\";d:52.39999999999999857891452847979962825775146484375;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000197/yK4an0TsKb_20240122120730_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 01:08:20', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-03-11 03:40:18', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000198', 'fosroc-rebaklens-rr1ltr', 'FOSROC REBAKLENS RR-1LTR', 'Simple', 'CS NA FORR 008', 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', NULL, '', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 550, 450, 'auto', '<p>Reebaklens RR cleaning agent is a combination of acid based material, corrosion inhibitors and dispersing agents and is supplied as a clear green solution.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Rapid action Safe with metals (except zinc and galvanised steel), wood, glass, plastic and rubber. No corrosive action. Penetrates oil and grease.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering FOSROC REBAKLENS RR-1LTR to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000198/cdLqu9ufqn_20240122124258.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1169;s:6:\"height\";i:1169;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000198/cdLqu9ufqn_20240122124258.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:876.75;s:6:\"height\";d:876.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000198/cdLqu9ufqn_20240122124258_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:584.5;s:6:\"height\";d:584.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000198/cdLqu9ufqn_20240122124258_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:292.25;s:6:\"height\";d:292.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000198/cdLqu9ufqn_20240122124258_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:116.900000000000005684341886080801486968994140625;s:6:\"height\";d:116.900000000000005684341886080801486968994140625;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000198/cdLqu9ufqn_20240122124258_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 01:44:35', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-07-16 04:34:34', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000199', 'rendroc-rg-25kg', 'Rendroc RG (25KG)', 'Simple', 'CS NA RENRG 009', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000199/622a3d3abe7b4a41daaf9a109d225296.pdf', '38245090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000003', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 750, 550, 'auto', '<p>Renderoc RG is supplied as a ready to use blend of dry powders which requires only the site addition of clean water to produce a free-fl owing non-shrink repair micro concrete. The material is based on Portland cements, graded aggregates and fi llers, and additives which impart controlled expansion characteristics in the plastic state, while minimising water demand. The low water requirement ensures high early strength and long-term durability. For larger repairs, the mixed Renderoc RG may be modifi ed by the addition of 5mm to 12mm clean, graded, saturated surface dry aggregates at site. For exceptionally large repairs, the local Fosroc offi ce shall be consulted.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Gaseous expansion system compensates for shrinkage and settlement in the plastic state.  Can be pumped or poured into restricted locations.  Highly fl uid to allow for placement without vibration.  Pre-packed to overcome site-batched variations.  Rapid strength gain to facilitate early reinstatement.  High ultimate strengths and low permeability of cured repair.  Contains no chloride admixture. Ensures piletop integrity as part of a waterproofi ng system Resistant to Alkali Silica Reaction or Alkali Aggregate Reaction.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Rendroc RG (25KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000199/nnMggSx4WN_20240122125556.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:585;s:6:\"height\";i:585;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000199/nnMggSx4WN_20240122125556.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:438.75;s:6:\"height\";d:438.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000199/nnMggSx4WN_20240122125556_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:292.5;s:6:\"height\";d:292.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000199/nnMggSx4WN_20240122125556_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:146.25;s:6:\"height\";d:146.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000199/nnMggSx4WN_20240122125556_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:58.5;s:6:\"height\";d:58.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000199/nnMggSx4WN_20240122125556_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 02:01:49', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000200', 'concure-wb-white-20ltr', 'Concure WB  White (20ltr)', 'Simple', 'CS NA CWBW 012', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000200/f0eadd55f2c452b105c40c3e52e25d1e.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 3900, 3400, 'auto', '<p>Concure WB Clear is a white colour, low viscosity milk emulsion which incorporates a special alkali reactive emulsion breaking system. It is supplied as a white emulsion which forms a white fi lm on drying. This system ensures that the emulsion breaks down to form a non penetrating continuous fi lm immediately upon contact with a cementitious surface. This impervious fi lm prevents excessive water evaporation which in turn permits more effi cient cement hydration, thus reducing shrinkage and increasing durability. Once formed, the membrane will remain on the concrete surface until eventually broken down and eroded by natural weathering. Where it is required to apply a further treatment to such concrete surface, it may be necessary to remove the membrane remaining after curing by wire brushing or other mechanical means. Water based concrete curing compound&nbsp;The use of curing membranes on internal floor slabs is generally to be avoided where additional surface fi nishes are to be applied. Concure WB White is however ideal where the concrete surface of a fl oor slab is to be left as &lsquo;fi nished&rsquo;.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Single application : Forms moisture barrier for whole of the curing period.  No other curing necessary : Eliminates use of water, hessian or sand completely.  Reliable : No risk of erratic or poor curing and ensures that cement hydrates effi ciently.  Ensures hard-wearing surface : Minimises risk of drying shrinkage, cracks and dusty surfaces.  Easy and safe spray application: Non-toxic and nonfl ammable.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Concure WB &nbsp;White (20ltr) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000200/1lnspcym3E_20240122131327.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:551;s:6:\"height\";i:551;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000200/1lnspcym3E_20240122131327.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:413.25;s:6:\"height\";d:413.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000200/1lnspcym3E_20240122131327_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:275.5;s:6:\"height\";d:275.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000200/1lnspcym3E_20240122131327_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:137.75;s:6:\"height\";d:137.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000200/1lnspcym3E_20240122131327_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:55.10000000000000142108547152020037174224853515625;s:6:\"height\";d:55.10000000000000142108547152020037174224853515625;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000200/1lnspcym3E_20240122131327_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 02:14:18', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-01-29 01:45:20', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_products` (`ProductID`, `Slug`, `ProductName`, `ProductType`, `ProductCode`, `Stages`, `VideoURL`, `ProductBrochure`, `HSNSAC`, `CID`, `SCID`, `UID`, `MinQty`, `MaxQty`, `RelatedProducts`, `TaxType`, `TaxID`, `PRate`, `SRate`, `Decimals`, `Description`, `ShortDescription`, `Attributes`, `ProductImage`, `Images`, `ActiveStatus`, `DFlag`, `CreatedOn`, `CreatedBy`, `UpdatedOn`, `UpdatedBy`, `DeletedOn`, `DeletedBy`) VALUES
('P2024-0000201', 'conplast-nc-20-ltr', 'Conplast NC (20 Ltr)', 'Simple', 'CS NA CNC 015', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000201/41ae2d83d741d39cba9514aed7bd297c.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 3300, 3100, 'auto', '<p>Conplast NC is guaranteed completely free of all forms of chloride and is supplied as a light straw coloured liquid. The main active ingredient is an inorganic formate.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Chloride free, safe in prestressed and reinforced concrete  Produces exceptionally high early strengths  Plasticising action gives increased workability and / or increased strengths  Early setting improves frost resistance  Suitable for bricklaying mortar mixes  Particularly eff ective in concrete at low temperatures</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering Conplast NC (20 Ltr) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000201/I0XtSPFdVz_20240122131914.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:531;s:6:\"height\";i:531;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000201/I0XtSPFdVz_20240122131914.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:398.25;s:6:\"height\";d:398.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000201/I0XtSPFdVz_20240122131914_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:265.5;s:6:\"height\";d:265.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000201/I0XtSPFdVz_20240122131914_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:132.75;s:6:\"height\";d:132.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000201/I0XtSPFdVz_20240122131914_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:53.10000000000000142108547152020037174224853515625;s:6:\"height\";d:53.10000000000000142108547152020037174224853515625;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000201/I0XtSPFdVz_20240122131914_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 02:20:49', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000202', 'conplast-sd110-20-kg', 'CONPLAST SD110 20 KG', 'Simple', 'CS NA CSD 016', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000202/3786f911240cca8b0e7302605b25f0d0.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 1150, 1050, 'auto', '<p>Conplast SD110 is a brown liquid which has been formulated for optimum performance as a cement saver under manufacturing conditions encountered in Concrete blocks. Improved formulation helps in both cement dispersion and compaction, maximising the strength obtained from the cement used.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Cement saving - strength, density and yield maintained with less cement.  Increased strengths - higher strength without additional cement  Minimises the risk of segregation and bleeding and assists in the production of a dense, close textured surface, improving durability.  Reduction in breakages - reduced breakages through increased &lsquo;green strength&rsquo;.  Improved production - production cycle time can be reduced allowing more blocks to be produced in a given period.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering CONPLAST SD110 20 KG to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000202/p9lp4uxaQD_20240122144821.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:585;s:6:\"height\";i:585;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000202/p9lp4uxaQD_20240122144821.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:438.75;s:6:\"height\";d:438.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000202/p9lp4uxaQD_20240122144821_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:292.5;s:6:\"height\";d:292.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000202/p9lp4uxaQD_20240122144821_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:146.25;s:6:\"height\";d:146.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000202/p9lp4uxaQD_20240122144821_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:58.5;s:6:\"height\";d:58.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000202/p9lp4uxaQD_20240122144821_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 03:48:50', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000203', 'conplast-crystalline-30kg', 'CONPLAST CRYSTALLINE (30KG)', 'Simple', 'CS NA CCRY 018', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000203/92558684d6815e99ba4e82155b79ea77.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000003', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 2350, 2150, 'auto', NULL, '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering CONPLAST CRYSTALLINE (30KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000203/5UbT417zwd_20240122145326.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1062;s:6:\"height\";i:1062;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000203/5UbT417zwd_20240122145326.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:796.5;s:6:\"height\";d:796.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000203/5UbT417zwd_20240122145326_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:531;s:6:\"height\";d:531;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000203/5UbT417zwd_20240122145326_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:265.5;s:6:\"height\";d:265.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000203/5UbT417zwd_20240122145326_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:106.2000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:6:\"height\";d:106.2000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000203/5UbT417zwd_20240122145326_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 03:54:32', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000204', 'rendroc-sp40-25kg', 'RENDROC SP40 (25KG)', 'Simple', 'CS NA RSP 026', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000204/8a7f757f6930762f89a4eb59fb311666.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000003', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 980, 780, 'auto', '<p>Renderoc SP40 is supplied as a single component, ready to use blend of dry powders and fi bres which requires only the addition of clean water to produce a highly consistent, hand and spray grade, repair mortar suitable for most structural and load bearing repairs.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Cost effective - shrinkage control enables repairs to be completed &bdquo;right fi rst time暢. Very low rebound is an additional cost benefi t Enhanced durability - works in tandem with extremely low permeability to prolong effective working life Compatibility - aligns performance closer than ever before, to that of host concrete User friendly - specifi cally developed to provide an easyto-apply product, suitable for local conditions Defi nable performance - positive benefi ts are easily demonstrated via a single, simple measurement</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering RENDROC SP40 (25KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000204/jjANnB1TyD_20240122150117.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:994;s:6:\"height\";i:994;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000204/jjANnB1TyD_20240122150117.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:745.5;s:6:\"height\";d:745.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000204/jjANnB1TyD_20240122150117_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:497;s:6:\"height\";d:497;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000204/jjANnB1TyD_20240122150117_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:248.5;s:6:\"height\";d:248.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000204/jjANnB1TyD_20240122150117_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:99.400000000000005684341886080801486968994140625;s:6:\"height\";d:99.400000000000005684341886080801486968994140625;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000204/jjANnB1TyD_20240122150117_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 04:13:06', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000205', 'nitocote-cm210-white-23kg', 'NITOCOTE CM210 WHITE (23KG)', 'Simple', 'CS NA NCMW 029', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000205/a440ffb22ff97b4d510b126853714ee6.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 2400, 2200, 'auto', '<p>Nitocote CM210 two-component polymer modifi ed cementitious coating is supplied in pre-packaged form. The product is designed to be easily mixed on site using a slow speed drill fi tted with a mixing paddle and then applied to the substrate using either brush, trowel or spray. Roller application may also be used, however, fi nishing the surface with a trowel is recommended for best results. Nitocote CM210, available in grey and white, cures to form and elastomeric impermeable membrane</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Approved for use in contact with potable water.  Withstands high positive and negative hydrostatic pressures  Excellent crack accommodation after immersion.  Excellent bond to concrete and masonry.  Long working life.  Easy application by brush, roller, trowel or spray.  Bonds to green or damp concrete.  Effective barrier to sulphates and chlorides.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering NITOCOTE CM210 WHITE (23KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000205/ZCPfxBLlSt_20240122153953.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:484;s:6:\"height\";i:484;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000205/ZCPfxBLlSt_20240122153953.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:363;s:6:\"height\";d:363;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000205/ZCPfxBLlSt_20240122153953_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:242;s:6:\"height\";d:242;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000205/ZCPfxBLlSt_20240122153953_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:121;s:6:\"height\";d:121;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000205/ZCPfxBLlSt_20240122153953_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:48.39999999999999857891452847979962825775146484375;s:6:\"height\";d:48.39999999999999857891452847979962825775146484375;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000205/ZCPfxBLlSt_20240122153953_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 04:42:29', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000206', 'auramix-20041250kg', 'AURAMIX 200-41(250KG)', 'Simple', 'CS A AUR 002', NULL, NULL, '', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000017', 'PSC2024-0000060', 'UOM2024-0000007', 0, 0, NULL, 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000002', 66, 56, 'auto', '<p>Auramix 200 is a unique combination of new generation super plasticizer based on polycarboxilic ether polymer with long lateral chain. Electrostatic dispersion mechanism considerably reduces the water demand in fl owable concrete. It is supplied as a light brown liquid, instantly dispersible in water. Auramix 200 disperses the cement particles eff ectively in the concrete mix and hence exposes a larger surface area to the hydration process. This eff ect is used either to increase the strength or to produce high workability concrete or reduce cement content of concrete</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Low viscosity admixture suitable for pumping diff erent grades of concrete to greater heights.  Suitable for concrete having cement replacements and low water cement ratio.  Provides higher strength without increase in cement content or reduction in workability. Ideal for precast concrete production.  Reduce rate of workability loss normally associated with super plasticiser. Reduces shrinkage cracking because of lower water cement ratio. Makes the concrete water impermeable.  Better resistance to Carbonation.  Reduce Shrinkage and Creep.  Increase Durability.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering AURAMIX 200-41(250KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000206/1DZtgiCW0S_20240122160544.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1277;s:6:\"height\";i:1277;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000206/1DZtgiCW0S_20240122160544.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:957.75;s:6:\"height\";d:957.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000206/1DZtgiCW0S_20240122160544_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:638.5;s:6:\"height\";d:638.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000206/1DZtgiCW0S_20240122160544_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:319.25;s:6:\"height\";d:319.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000206/1DZtgiCW0S_20240122160544_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:127.7000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:6:\"height\";d:127.7000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000206/1DZtgiCW0S_20240122160544_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 05:07:24', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-02-22 04:01:39', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000207', 'auramix-20020250kg', 'AURAMIX 200-20(250KG)', 'Simple', 'CS A AUR 003', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000207/f80cc8e2dc031c5db2cba49d57fdcfd8.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000017', 'PSC2024-0000060', 'UOM2024-0000007', 0, 0, NULL, 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000002', 75, 65, 'auto', '<p>Auramix 200 is a unique combination of new generation super plasticizer based on polycarboxilic ether polymer with long lateral chain. Electrostatic dispersion mechanism considerably reduces the water demand in fl owable concrete. It is supplied as a light brown liquid, instantly dispersible in water. Auramix 200 disperses the cement particles eff ectively in the concrete mix and hence exposes a larger surface area to the hydration process. This eff ect is used either to increase the strength or to produce high workability concrete or reduce cement content of concrete.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Low viscosity admixture suitable for pumping diff erent grades of concrete to greater heights.  Suitable for concrete having cement replacements and low water cement ratio.  Provides higher strength without increase in cement content or reduction in workability. Ideal for precast concrete production.  Reduce rate of workability loss normally associated with super plasticiser. Reduces shrinkage cracking because of lower water cement ratio. Makes the concrete water impermeable.  Better resistance to Carbonation.  Reduce Shrinkage and Creep.  Increase Durability</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering AURAMIX 200-20(250KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:1:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000004\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:0:{}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000207/NKwWMTxqdr_20240122161520.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1277;s:6:\"height\";i:1277;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000207/NKwWMTxqdr_20240122161520.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:957.75;s:6:\"height\";d:957.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000207/NKwWMTxqdr_20240122161520_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:638.5;s:6:\"height\";d:638.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000207/NKwWMTxqdr_20240122161520_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:319.25;s:6:\"height\";d:319.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000207/NKwWMTxqdr_20240122161520_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:127.7000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:6:\"height\";d:127.7000000000000028421709430404007434844970703125;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000207/NKwWMTxqdr_20240122161520_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 05:16:25', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-03-07 01:33:29', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000208', 'auramix-300250kg', 'AURAMIX 300(250KG)', 'Simple', 'CS A AUR 004', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000208/34b956a944502b65579ff2a95c3fc19f.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000017', 'PSC2024-0000060', 'UOM2024-0000007', 0, 0, NULL, 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000002', 95, 85, 'auto', '<p>Auramix 300 is a unique combination of the latest generation superplasticisers , based on a polycarboxylic ether polymer with long lateral chains. This greatly improves cement dispersion. At the start of the mixing process an electrostatic dispersion occurs but the cement particle&rsquo;s capacity to separate and disperse. This mechanism considerably reduces the water demand in fl owable concrete. Auramix 300 combines the properties of water reduction and workability retention. It allows the production of high performance concrete and/or concrete with high workability&nbsp;Auramix 300 is a strong superplasticiser allowing production of consistent concrete properties around the required dosage.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Increased retardation controls the heat of hydration and yields high ultimate strength Arrest bleeding and segregation due to presence of in-built VMA.  Higher E modulus  Improved adhesion to reinforcing and prestressing steel  Better resistance to carbonation  Lower permeability  Better resistance to aggressive atmospheric conditions  Reduced shrinkage and creep  Increased durability</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering AURAMIX 300(250KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:1:{s:14:\"AT2024-0000004\";a:2:{s:11:\"isVariation\";b:0;s:4:\"data\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:7:\"ValueID\";s:15:\"ATV2024-0000087\";s:5:\"Value\";s:9:\"Admixture\";}}}}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000208/1Xm1dkgbM6_20240122162311.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:793;s:6:\"height\";i:793;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000208/1Xm1dkgbM6_20240122162311.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:594.75;s:6:\"height\";d:594.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000208/1Xm1dkgbM6_20240122162311_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:396.5;s:6:\"height\";d:396.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000208/1Xm1dkgbM6_20240122162311_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:198.25;s:6:\"height\";d:198.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000208/1Xm1dkgbM6_20240122162311_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:79.2999999999999971578290569595992565155029296875;s:6:\"height\";d:79.2999999999999971578290569595992565155029296875;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000208/1Xm1dkgbM6_20240122162311_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 05:26:01', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-03-07 01:35:07', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000209', 'cebex-112200kg', 'CEBEX 112(200KG)', 'Simple', 'CS A CEB 007', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000209/a83e349a1ff21676ef84ba5c652c8ded.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000060', 'UOM2024-0000007', 0, 0, NULL, 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000002', 46, 36, 'auto', '<p>Cebex 112 is supplied as an off-white to pale yellow liquid which mixes readily with water in any proportions. It is based on internationally recognised chemicals and is free from calcium chloride and similar salts.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Improved moisture retention and bond strength: Slows down drying out of mortar which remains workable longer. Ensures better bond to all surfaces, including ceiling.  Makes mortar crack resistant : Minimises drying shrinkage cracks and increases frost resistance in cold climates.  High workability : Even with harsh sands, makes creamy easy-to-apply mortar.  Cost saving : Increase yield of the same quantity of sand/ cement. Extra coverage normally exceeds material costs.  Better &amp; safer masonry : Mortar fills joints easily and efficiently and ensures stronger construction.  Improved appearance : Mortar cuts cleanly from faces of brick, block or stone work.  Increased productivity : Speeds up work by easy application of mortar.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering CEBEX 112(200KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000209/aTE3eNjELz_20240122174927.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1056;s:6:\"height\";i:1056;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000209/aTE3eNjELz_20240122174927.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:792;s:6:\"height\";d:792;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000209/aTE3eNjELz_20240122174927_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:528;s:6:\"height\";d:528;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000209/aTE3eNjELz_20240122174927_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:264;s:6:\"height\";d:264;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000209/aTE3eNjELz_20240122174927_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:105.599999999999994315658113919198513031005859375;s:6:\"height\";d:105.599999999999994315658113919198513031005859375;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000209/aTE3eNjELz_20240122174927_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 06:49:38', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000210', 'concure-wb-white200kg', 'CONCURE WB WHITE(200KG)', 'Simple', 'CS A CWW 008', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000210/86ba379284f45863928eea5b33488bcc.pdf', '38244090', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000060', 'UOM2024-0000007', 0, 0, NULL, 'Exclude', 'TX2023-0000002', 97, 87, 'auto', '<p>Concure WB Clear is a white colour, low viscosity milk emulsion which incorporates a special alkali reactive emulsion breaking system. It is supplied as a white emulsion which forms a white fi lm on drying. This system ensures that the emulsion breaks down to form a non penetrating continuous fi lm immediately upon contact with a cementitious surface. This impervious fi lm prevents excessive water evaporation which in turn permits more effi cient cement hydration, thus reducing shrinkage and increasing durability. Once formed, the membrane will remain on the concrete surface until eventually broken down and eroded by natural weathering. Where it is required to apply a further treatment to such concrete surface, it may be necessary to remove the membrane remaining after curing by wire brushing or other mechanical means.The use of curing membranes on internal floor slabs is generally to be avoided where additional surface fi nishes are to be applied. Concure WB White is however ideal where the concrete surface of a fl oor slab is to be left as &lsquo;fi nished&rsquo;.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p> Single application : Forms moisture barrier for whole of the curing period.  No other curing necessary : Eliminates use of water, hessian or sand completely.  Reliable : No risk of erratic or poor curing and ensures that cement hydrates effi ciently.  Ensures hard-wearing surface : Minimises risk of drying shrinkage, cracks and dusty surfaces.  Easy and safe spray application: Non-toxic and nonfl ammable.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering CONCURE WB WHITE(200KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000210/ef6HweTha3_20240122181256.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1056;s:6:\"height\";i:1056;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000210/ef6HweTha3_20240122181256.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:792;s:6:\"height\";d:792;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000210/ef6HweTha3_20240122181256_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:528;s:6:\"height\";d:528;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000210/ef6HweTha3_20240122181256_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:264;s:6:\"height\";d:264;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000210/ef6HweTha3_20240122181256_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:105.599999999999994315658113919198513031005859375;s:6:\"height\";d:105.599999999999994315658113919198513031005859375;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000210/ef6HweTha3_20240122181256_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-22 07:17:18', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
