 flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering MASTER EMACO SBR 2 (5L) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000310/lWRPg0fgSb_20240125145004.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:532;s:6:\"height\";i:532;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000310/lWRPg0fgSb_20240125145004.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:399;s:6:\"height\";i:399;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000310/lWRPg0fgSb_20240125145004_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:266;s:6:\"height\";i:266;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000310/lWRPg0fgSb_20240125145004_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:133;s:6:\"height\";i:133;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000310/lWRPg0fgSb_20240125145004_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:53.2;s:6:\"height\";d:53.2;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000310/lWRPg0fgSb_20240125145004_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-25 03:50:19', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('P2024-0000311', 'master-tile-100-bright-white3kg', 'MASTER TILE 100 BRIGHT WHITE(3KG)', 'Simple', 'CS NA MTW 042', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000311/f1ff415ff26d83e424264cd7b889b2ad.pdf', '32141000', 'PC2024-0000004', 'PSC2024-0000059', 'UOM2023-0000001', 0, 0, NULL, 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 2800, 2600, 'auto', '<p>Epoxy resin-based tile grouting system for pavers, ceramic tiles, stone tiles, mosaics and acid resistant tiles in medium and heavy-duty corrosive and hygienic environments. MasterTile 100 is available in selective twelve shades.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Excellent resistance to most aqueous systems including sewerage, urine, salt water, dilute acid and alkali, oils and fats Stain free finish &ndash; Excellent resistance to stain Non- absorbent easy to clean and hygienic in service Crack-free and non-shrink- curing and setting without shrinkage and very high adhesion to tiles and substrate. Resistant to frost and weathering - multipurpose use indoors and outdoors. Good Workability - easy to apply. Non-Sag Consistency - Suitable for vertical and horizontal application Coloured -Available in range of 12 colour shades.</p>', '<p>RPC is mainly engaged in the field of manufacturing and wholesaling trading of various types of Construction Materials since 2015. Various products range consists of RPC BUILDER SUPPLY, RPC BLUE METALS, RPC CONSTRUCTION SOLUTIONS, RPC DESIGNER &amp; CONSTRUCTION PLANNING and Robotics Bricks and Blocks. These products are widely appreciated for their high purity, user-friendliness, longevity, and low rates. Additionally, we are also offering Architectural and Construction Services to our valued clients. We always maintain on the flawless design of the manufacturing process, verifying quality standards as per customer&#39;s specification, choice of quality raw materials, good workmanship and quality control at all stages of our manufacturing process. We are engaged in offering MASTER TILE 100 BRIGHT WHITE(3KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000311/qBHqsad33I_20240125145906.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:509;s:6:\"height\";i:509;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000311/qBHqsad33I_20240125145906.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:381.75;s:6:\"height\";d:381.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000311/qBHqsad33I_20240125145906_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:254.5;s:6:\"height\";d:254.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000311/qBHqsad33I_20240125145906_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:127.25;s:6:\"height\";d:127.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000311/qBHqsad33I_20240125145906_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:50.9;s:6:\"height\";d:50.9;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000311/qBHqsad33I_20240125145906_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-25 04:00:08', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-01-25 04:09:21', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
