 (1KG) to our clients. Our range of all products is widely appreciated by our clients.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000312/BQxXiGrB8e_20240125150252.png', 'a:5:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:400;s:6:\"height\";i:400;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000312/BQxXiGrB8e_20240125150252.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000312/BQxXiGrB8e_20240125150252_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:200;s:6:\"height\";i:200;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000312/BQxXiGrB8e_20240125150252_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:100;s:6:\"height\";i:100;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000312/BQxXiGrB8e_20240125150252_25.png\";}i:10;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:40;s:6:\"height\";i:40;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2024-0000312/BQxXiGrB8e_20240125150252_10.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-01-25 04:04:15', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-01-25 04:10:59', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL),
