('P2425-0000030', 'myk-709-filler-powder-burgundy-075kg', 'Myk 709 Filler Powder Burgundy - 0.75Kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=fUlkyU_VWaZ9ICtR', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000030/8b0abd171f4ee3e52f32ce904f8431bb.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 650, 350, 'auto', '<p>Myk 7109 Filler Powder Burgundy is a premium-grade filler designed for surface repair and preparation in various industries, including automotive, marine, and construction. This filler powder, when mixed with an appropriate resin, forms a strong, resilient compound that effectively fills cracks, dents, and surface imperfections on materials like metal, wood, and fiberglass.</p>\n\n<p>The rich Burgundy color is not only aesthetically pleasing but also serves a practical purpose by enhancing visibility during application. This ensures even coverage and allows for precise application, especially important in projects requiring color-specific finishes. Once applied, the compound cures to a hard, durable state that is easy to sand, providing a smooth, even surface ready for further finishing or painting.</p>\n\n<p>Myk 7109 Filler Powder Burgundy is ideal for situations where color matching is critical, and its strong adhesive properties ensure a long-lasting repair. It is commonly used in automotive bodywork, furniture repair, and other detailed restoration projects, where both performance and appearance are essential.</p>', '<p>Myk 7109 Filler Powder in Burgundy is a high-performance filler used for repairing and smoothing surfaces in various industrial applications. The rich Burgundy color helps ensure precise application and easy visibility during the repair process. When mixed with a compatible resin, this filler creates a robust, durable compound ideal for filling gaps, cracks, and dents in materials like metal, wood, or fiberglass. After curing, the fil