Improves workability, strength, and adhesion of mortars, plasters, and concrete.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Reduction:</strong> Minimizes shrinkage during curing, reducing the risk of cracks.</li>\n	<li><strong>Applications:</strong> Suitable for use in masonry mortars, plasters, concrete mixes, and repair works.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Ideal for both new constructions and renovation projects, Myk 789 Filler Powder #Smoke Grey ensures high-quality results and enhanced durability.</p>\n\n<p><button></button><button></button></p>\n\n<p><button></button></p>\n\n<p><button id=\"radix-:rii:\"></button></p>\n\n<p><button id=\"radix-:rii:\"></button></p>\n\n<p>4o mini<button></button></p>\n\n<p><button></button></p>\n\n<h5>You said:</h5>\n\n<p>Myk 791 Filler Powder#Slate Grey description</p>\n\n<p><button></button></p>\n\n<h6>ChatGPT said:</h6>\n\n<p>ChatGPT</p>\n\n<p><strong>Myk 791 Filler Powder #Slate Grey</strong> is a premium filler powder designed for use in various construction applications. Here&#39;s a brief description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk 791 Filler Powder #Slate Grey is a high-performance, fine-grade powder that enhances the quality and durability of construction mixes. Its slate grey color offers an elegant and modern appearance, making it suitable for both aesthetic and functional purposes.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Slate grey, providing a sophisticated and contemporary finish that blends well with different design styles.</li>\n	<li><strong>Quality Composition:</strong> Crafted from high-grade materials for consistent performance and reliability.</li>\n	<li><strong>Improved Workability:</strong> Enhances the ease of mixing, handling, and applying mortars, plasters, and concrete.</li>\n	<li><strong>Strength Enhancement:</strong> Contributes to increased compressive and tensile strength in construction materials.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Control:</strong> Reduce