<br />\n<button id=\"radix-:rj2:\"></button></p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000040/hkhcbwZA5f_20240831172638.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000040/hkhcbwZA5f_20240831172638.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000040/hkhcbwZA5f_20240831172638_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000040/hkhcbwZA5f_20240831172638_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000040/hkhcbwZA5f_20240831172638_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 10:19:01', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 11:56:44', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000041', 'myk-792filler-powder-saltillo-375kg', 'Myk 792-Filler Powder Saltillo - 3.75Kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=fUlkyU_VWaZ9ICtR', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000041/c1142f0d7bb20ac403f4874b959ed04b.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 1300, 1000, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk 792 Filler Powder Saltillo</strong> is a high-quality, fine-grade construction filler powder known for its warm, terracotta-like color. This product is designed to enhance the strength, workability, and aesthetic appeal of mortars, plasters, and concrete. The Saltillo color provides a natural, earthy tone, making it ideal for both decorative and structural applications. It also improves the mix&#39;s adhesion and reduces shrinkage during curing, ensuring a durable and crack-resistant finish. Suitable for use in a wide range of construction projects, Myk 792 Filler Powder Saltillo offers both functionality and aesthetic value.</p>', '<p><strong>Myk 792 Filler Powder Saltillo</strong> is a premium construction filler powder designed to enhance the properties and performance of various building materials. Here&#39;s a full description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk 792 Filler Powder Saltillo is a versatile, high-quality filler powder used to improve the strength, workability, and aesthetic appeal of construction materials such as mortars, plasters, and concrete. The Saltillo color adds a warm, earthy tone, making it ideal for decorative and functional applications.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> The Saltillo hue provides a warm, terracotta-like appearance that adds a natural, rustic touch to surfaces.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>High-Quality Composition:</strong> Manufactured using premium raw materials to ensure consistent quality and performance in all applications.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Enhanced Workability:</strong> Improves the ease of mixing and application, allowing for smoother finishes and easier handling.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Increased Strength:</strong> Contributes to higher compressive and tensile strengths in concrete and mortar, enhancing structural integrity.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Shrinkage Reduction:</strong> Minimizes shrinkage during the curing process, reducing the likelihood of cracks and surface imperfections.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Excellent Adhesion:</strong> Enhances bonding to substrates, ensuring long-lasting durability and stability.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Versatile Compatibility:</strong> Compatible with various types of cements and other construction materials, making it adaptable to a wide range of projects.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Aesthetic Appeal:</strong> The Saltillo color is perfect for projects requiring a natural, earthy look, ideal for both interior and exterior applications.</p>\n	</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Mortars:</strong> Enhances the properties of masonry mortars, providing strength and a uniform color.</li>\n	<li><strong>Plasters:</strong> Ideal for creating smooth, durable plaster finishes with a warm, natural tone.</li>\n	<li><strong>Concrete:</strong> Improves the performance and appearance of concrete mixes, suitable for both structural and decorative applications.</li>\n	<li><strong>Repairs:</strong> Effective for filling gaps and repairing surfaces, ensuring a high-quality, aesthetically pleasing finish.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Incorporate Myk 792 Filler Powder Saltillo into the mix in the recommended proportions, following the manufacturer&rsquo;s guidelines for the best results.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ensure surfaces are clean and dry before application. Apply the mix using standard construction techniques to achieve a consistent finish.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the appropriate curing time as specified for the particular application to ensure optimal strength and durability.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place, away from moisture to maintain the product&rsquo;s effectiveness.</li>\n	<li>Keep the product sealed in its original packaging when not in use to prevent contamination.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow standard safety protocols when handling and applying the filler powder.</li>\n	<li>Use personal protective equipment (PPE) such as gloves and masks to avoid inhalation and skin contact.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>For more specific technical data and detailed application guidelines, always refer to the manufacturer&rsquo;s technical datasheet and product label.<br />\n<button id=\"radix-:rju:\"></button></p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000041/I8x8Iq42Gt_20240831172739.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000041/I8x8Iq42Gt_20240831172739.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000041/I8x8Iq42Gt_20240831172739_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000041/I8x8Iq42Gt_20240831172739_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000041/I8x8Iq42Gt_20240831172739_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 10:22:14', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 11:58:27', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000042', 'myk-epoxy-black-1kg', 'Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', NULL, '', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 550, 500, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg</strong> is a high-performance, industrial-grade epoxy resin designed for a variety of construction and repair applications. Here&#39;s a brief description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy - Black is a durable, two-component epoxy system available in a 1kg pack. It is formulated to provide excellent bonding, sealing, and protective properties, with a deep black color that adds an aesthetic appeal.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Strong Adhesion:</strong> Offers superior bonding strength to a wide range of surfaces, including concrete, metal, and wood.</li>\n	<li><strong>High Durability:</strong> Resistant to wear, chemicals, and environmental factors, ensuring long-lasting performance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Provides a sleek, black finish that is both functional and visually appealing.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Applications:</strong> Suitable for use in flooring, crack repairs, protective coatings, and other construction tasks.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy to Use:</strong> The two components are easy to mix and apply, with a manageable curing time.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Flooring:</strong> Ideal for creating durable, attractive epoxy floors in industrial, commercial, and residential spaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Repairs:</strong> Used for filling and repairing cracks, gaps, and defects in concrete surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Coatings:</strong> Provides a protective, aesthetically pleasing coating for metal and other surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Bonding:</strong> Excellent for joining different materials where strong adhesion is required.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the two components of the epoxy in the recommended ratio until a uniform black color is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply to clean, dry surfaces using a trowel, brush, or roller, depending on the specific application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow sufficient curing time as specified in the product instructions to achieve optimal hardness and durability.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li>Keep containers tightly sealed when not in use.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow safety guidelines, including using gloves and protective eyewear.</li>\n	<li>Ensure adequate ventilation during application.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg is an ideal solution for construction professionals and DIY enthusiasts looking for a reliable, aesthetically pleasing epoxy system for various applications.<button id=\"radix-:rlb:\"></button></p>', '<p><strong>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg</strong> is a high-performance, two-component epoxy system designed for a wide range of construction and industrial applications. This product is ideal for tasks requiring strong adhesion, durability, and a sleek black finish. Here&rsquo;s a full description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy - Black 1kg is a professional-grade epoxy resin and hardener system, formulated to provide exceptional bonding, chemical resistance, and long-lasting durability. The black color adds a modern, sophisticated appearance, making it suitable for both functional and aesthetic applications.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Strong Adhesion:</strong> Offers superior bonding to various substrates, including concrete, metal, wood, and plastics.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Durability:</strong> Provides excellent resistance to wear, impact, and abrasion, ensuring long-term performance even in harsh environments.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Chemical Resistance:</strong> Withstands exposure to chemicals, oils, and solvents, making it ideal for industrial settings.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The black epoxy cures to a smooth, glossy finish that enhances the appearance of surfaces while providing protection.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Versatile Applications:</strong> Suitable for use in flooring, coatings, repairs, and bonding applications across various industries.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Waterproofing:</strong> Forms a waterproof barrier, protecting surfaces from moisture ingress and corrosion.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Easy to Mix and Apply:</strong> The two-component system is easy to mix and apply, ensuring consistent results with minimal effort.</p>\n	</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Floor Coatings:</strong> Ideal for creating durable, chemical-resistant floors in garages, workshops, and industrial areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Surface Repairs:</strong> Perfect for repairing cracks, gaps, and surface defects in concrete, metal, and wood.</li>\n	<li><strong>Adhesive Bonding:</strong> Provides strong, reliable bonding for various materials in construction and manufacturing.</li>\n	<li><strong>Protective Coatings:</strong> Suitable for protective coatings on machinery, tools, and other equipment exposed to harsh conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Mixing and Application Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the epoxy resin and hardener in the specified ratio (typically 1:1 by volume), ensuring a thorough mix until a uniform black color is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Clean and dry the surface to remove any dirt, grease, or loose particles before application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed epoxy using a brush, roller, or trowel, depending on the application. Ensure even coverage for the best results.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the epoxy to cure for the recommended time. Full curing typically occurs within 24 hours, depending on the temperature and humidity.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li>Keep the containers tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and ensure product longevity.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow all safety guidelines when handling and applying Myk Epoxy.</li>\n	<li>Wear appropriate personal protective equipment (PPE), including gloves, masks, and eye protection, to avoid skin contact and inhalation of fumes.</li>\n	<li>Ensure adequate ventilation in the workspace during application and curing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>For specific technical details, always refer to the manufacturer&rsquo;s technical datasheet and product label.</p>', 'a:0:{}', '', 'a:0:{}', 'Active', 1, '2024-08-28 10:30:46', 'U2023-0000002', NULL, NULL, '2024-08-31 11:59:34', 'U2024-0001505'),
('P2425-0000043', 'myk-793-epoxy-filler-375kg-platinum', 'Myk - 793- Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=fUlkyU_VWaZ9ICtR', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000043/730414e8bcbef6a55304177e19f24318.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 1300, 1000, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum</strong> is a high-performance, two-component epoxy filler designed to provide exceptional strength and durability for a variety of construction and repair applications. Here&rsquo;s a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum is formulated to deliver superior bonding and filling capabilities. With its platinum color, it offers both functionality and an aesthetically pleasing finish, making it suitable for industrial, commercial, and residential use.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Platinum, providing a modern, sleek appearance that complements a variety of surfaces and finishes.</li>\n	<li><strong>High Mechanical Strength:</strong> Delivers excellent structural integrity and resistance to physical stress, making it ideal for high-traffic areas and heavy-duty applications.</li>\n	<li><strong>Superior Adhesion:</strong> Bonds strongly to a wide range of substrates, including concrete, metal, wood, and masonry.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Application:</strong> Suitable for filling cracks, gaps, and voids, as well as for surface repairs and general maintenance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Once cured, the filler provides a smooth, even surface that can be easily sanded, painted, or finished as required.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Mixing and Application:</strong> The two-component system is straightforward to mix and apply, ensuring reliable performance and ease of use.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Surface Repairs:</strong> Ideal for repairing and restoring damaged or worn surfaces, including concrete floors, walls, and structural elements.</li>\n	<li><strong>Filling Gaps and Voids:</strong> Effective for filling cracks, holes, and gaps in various substrates to create a seamless surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>General Maintenance:</strong> Suitable for maintenance tasks where a durable, high-strength filler is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Preparation:</strong> Ensure the surface to be repaired is clean, dry, and free of any loose material or contaminants.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the two components of Myk Epoxy Filler according to the manufacturer&#39;s instructions. Mix thoroughly until a uniform consistency and color are achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed filler to the prepared surface using appropriate tools, such as a trowel or putty knife. Smooth the surface to achieve the desired finish.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the filler to cure as per the product&rsquo;s specifications. Full curing times may vary based on environmental conditions such as temperature and humidity.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Conditions:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Keep containers tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and premature curing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Precautions:</strong> Follow standard safety guidelines, including wearing protective gloves, eyewear, and ensuring adequate ventilation during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Handling:</strong> Avoid contact with skin and eyes. In case of accidental contact, rinse thoroughly with water and seek medical attention if necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Packaging Size:</strong> 3.75kg</li>\n	<li><strong>Component Ratio:</strong> As per manufacturer&#39;s instructions.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application Tools:</strong> Trowel, putty knife, or similar tools.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum</strong> offers a reliable, high-strength solution for a wide range of repair and maintenance tasks, providing both durability and a high-quality finish.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<button id=\"radix-:rmd:\"></button></p>', '<p><strong>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum</strong> is a high-quality, two-component epoxy filler designed for a range of construction and repair applications. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum is a durable, high-performance epoxy filler that provides excellent bonding and filling capabilities. It is suitable for both industrial and residential use, offering a versatile solution for various surface repair and maintenance needs.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Platinum, providing a sleek, modern appearance that blends well with various surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>High Strength:</strong> Offers superior mechanical strength and durability, making it ideal for demanding applications.</li>\n	<li><strong>Excellent Adhesion:</strong> Bonds well to a wide range of substrates including concrete, metal, and wood.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Can be used for filling cracks, gaps, and voids, as well as for general surface repairs and maintenance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Provides a smooth, even surface once cured, which can be sanded and painted if required.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Surface Repairs:</strong> Ideal for repairing cracks, holes, and other imperfections in concrete, metal, and wood surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Filling Gaps:</strong> Effective for filling gaps and voids in a variety of construction materials.</li>\n	<li><strong>Maintenance:</strong> Useful for maintaining and restoring surfaces in both industrial and residential settings.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the two components of the epoxy filler according to the manufacturer&#39;s instructions. Ensure thorough mixing until a uniform consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed filler to the prepared surface using a suitable tool, such as a trowel or putty knife. Smooth out the surface to achieve the desired finish.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the filler to cure fully as per the product instructions to ensure optimal strength and adhesion. Curing times may vary based on environmental conditions.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li>Keep containers tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and drying.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow standard safety precautions during handling and application, including wearing gloves and protective eyewear.</li>\n	<li>Ensure adequate ventilation in the application area.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum provides a reliable and effective solution for various repair and maintenance tasks, delivering both strength and a polished appearance to finished surfaces.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000043/0bucE2hesX_20240831173318.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000043/0bucE2hesX_20240831173318.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000043/0bucE2hesX_20240831173318_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000043/0bucE2hesX_20240831173318_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000043/0bucE2hesX_20240831173318_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 10:49:29', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:03:32', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL);
