strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the two components of the epoxy filler according to the manufacturer&#39;s instructions. Ensure thorough mixing until a uniform consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed filler to the prepared surface using a suitable tool, such as a trowel or putty knife. Smooth out the surface to achieve the desired finish.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the filler to cure fully as per the product instructions to ensure optimal strength and adhesion. Curing times may vary based on environmental conditions.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li>Keep containers tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and drying.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Follow standard safety precautions during handling and application, including wearing gloves and protective eyewear.</li>\n	<li>Ensure adequate ventilation in the application area.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum provides a reliable and effective solution for various repair and maintenance tasks, delivering both strength and a polished appearance to finished surfaces.</p>\n\n<p><button></button><button><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#333333; font-family:sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size:13px\">n</span></button><button></button></p>\n\n<p><strong>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum</strong> is a high-performance, two-component epoxy filler designed to provide exceptional strength and durability for a variety of construction and repair applications. Here&rsquo;s a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum is formulated to deliver superior bonding and filling capabilities. With its platinum color, it offers both functionality and an aesthetically pleasing finish, making it suitable for industrial, commercial, and residential use.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Platinum, providing a modern, sleek appearance that complements a variety of surfaces and finishes.</li>\n	<li><strong>High Mechanical Strength:</strong> Delivers excellent structural integrity and resistance to physical stress, making it ideal for high-traffic areas and heavy-duty applications.</li>\n	<li><strong>Superior Adhesion:</strong> Bonds strongly to a wide range of substrates, including concrete, metal, wood, and masonry.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Application:</strong> Suitable for filling cracks, gaps, and voids, as well as for surface repairs and general maintenance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Once cured, the filler provides a smooth, even surface that can be easily sanded, painted, or finished as required.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Mixing and Application:</strong> The two-component system is straightforward to mix and apply, ensuring reliable performance and ease of use.</li>\n</ul>', '<p><strong>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum</strong> is a high-quality, two-component epoxy filler designed for a range of construction and repair applications. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Epoxy Filler 3.75kg Platinum is a durable, high-performance epoxy filler that provides excellent bonding and filling capabilities. It is suitable for both industrial and residential use, offering a versatile solution for various surface repair and maintenance needs.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Platinum, providing a sleek, modern appearance that blends well with various surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>High Strength:</strong> Offers superior mechanical strength and durability, making it ideal for demanding appli