Versatile Compatibility:</strong> Compatible with different types of cements and other construction materials, providing flexibility in various applications.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Mortars:</strong> Ideal for improving the properties of masonry mortars, offering both enhanced strength and a refined appearance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Plasters:</strong> Suitable for achieving a smooth and durable plaster finish with a stylish metallic grey tone.</li>\n	<li><strong>Concrete:</strong> Enhances the performance and visual appeal of concrete mixes, making it suitable for both structural and decorative purposes.</li>\n	<li><strong>Repairs:</strong> Effective for filling gaps, cracks, and other imperfections, delivering a high-quality and aesthetically pleasing finish.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Add Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow to the mix in the recommended proportions specified by the manufacturer. Mix thoroughly until a uniform consistency and color are achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ensure the surface to be filled or repaired is clean, dry, and free of loose material. Apply the mixed filler using standard construction techniques.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the filler to cure according to the manufacturer&#39;s instructions to achieve optimal strength and finish.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Conditions:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture to prevent premature hardening.</li>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Keep the product sealed in its original packaging when not in use to maintain its quality and effectiveness.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Precautions:</strong> Follow standard safety practices, including wearing protective gloves and eyewear. Ensure adequate ventilation during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Handling:</strong> Avoid inhalation and contact with skin. In case of accidental contact, rinse thoroughly with water and seek medical advice if necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow</strong> offers a reliable and stylish solution for various construction and repair tasks, combining high performance with an attractive finish to meet both functional and aesthetic needs.</p>', '<p><strong>Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow</strong> is a premium construction filler designed to enhance both the functionality and aesthetics of various building materials. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow is a high-quality, fine-grade filler powder with a sophisticated silver shadow color. It is engineered to improve the performance of mortars, plasters, and concrete, offering both structural benefits and an attractive finish.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Silver shadow, providing a sleek and modern metallic grey finish that adds a refined look to surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>High-Quality Composition:</strong> Made from premium raw materials to ensure consistent performance and long-lasting results.</li>\n	<li><strong>Enhanced Workability:</strong> Improves the ease of mixing, handling, and applying construction materials, resulting in a smoother and more even finish.</li>\n	<li><strong>Increased Strength:</strong> Contributes to enhanced compressive and tensile strength in concrete and mortar applications, boosting overall durability.</li>\n	<li><strong>Reduced Shrinkage:</strong> Minimizes shrinkage during curing, helping to prevent cracks and surface imperfections.</li>\n	<li><strong>Excellent Adhesion:</strong> Promotes strong bonding to various substrates, ensuring stability and longevity.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Compatibility:</strong> Works effectively with different types of cements and construction materials.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Mortars:</strong> Ideal for enhancing the properties of masonry mortars, improving both strength and aesthetic appeal.</li>\n	<li><strong>Plasters:</strong> Suitable for creating a smooth and durable plaster finish with a stylish metallic grey color.</li>\n	<li><strong>Concrete:</strong> Enhances the performance and appearance of concrete mixes for both structural and decorative purposes.</li>\n	<li><strong>Repairs:</strong> Effective for filling gaps, cracks, and other imperfections, providing a high-quality and visually pleasing finish.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Add Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow to the mix in the recommended proportions as specified by the manufacturer. Mix thoroughly to achieve a uniform consistency and color.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ensure that the surface to be filled or repaired is clean, dry, and free of loose material. Apply the mixed filler using standard construction techniques.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the filler to cure according to the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions to achieve optimal strength and finish.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Conditions:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and moisture to prevent premature hardening.</li>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Keep the product sealed in its original packaging when not in use to maintain its quality and effectiveness.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Precautions:</strong> Follow standard safety practices, including wearing protective gloves and eyewear. Ensure adequate ventilation during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Handling:</strong> Avoid inhalation and contact with skin. In case of accidental contact, rinse thoroughly with water and seek medical advice if necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow</strong> offers a reliable and stylish solution for various construction and repair tasks, delivering high performance and an elegant finish.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000047/Tyu5pHGbfV_20240831173815.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000047/Tyu5pHGbfV_20240831173815.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000047/Tyu5pHGbfV_20240831173815_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000047/Tyu5pHGbfV_20240831173815_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000047/Tyu5pHGbfV_20240831173815_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 11:08:29', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:08:40', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_products` (`ProductID`, `Slug`, `ProductName`, `ProductType`, `ProductCode`, `Stages`, `VideoURL`, `ProductBrochure`, `HSNSAC`, `CID`, `SCID`, `UID`, `MinQty`, `MaxQty`, `RelatedProducts`, `TaxType`, `TaxID`, `PRate`, `SRate`, `Decimals`, `Description`, `ShortDescription`, `Attributes`, `ProductImage`, `Images`, `ActiveStatus`, `DFlag`, `CreatedOn`, `CreatedBy`, `UpdatedOn`, `UpdatedBy`, `DeletedOn`, `DeletedBy`) VALUES
('P2425-0000048', 'mykl-1776-grout-admix-plus-200ml', 'Myk-L 1776 Grout Admix Plus 200ml', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000048/b7f5e96493cc12471f72ccff000cbc25.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 550, 500, 'auto', '<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Improved Flexibility:</strong> Enhances the flexibility of grout, reducing the risk of cracking due to substrate movement or temperature changes.</li>\n	<li><strong>Superior Adhesion:</strong> Increases the bonding strength of the grout to tile edges and substrates, ensuring a more durable installation.</li>\n	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> Provides excellent resistance to water penetration, making it suitable for use in wet areas such as bathrooms, kitchens, and swimming pools.</li>\n	<li><strong>Enhanced Durability:</strong> Extends the life of grout joints by improving resistance to wear, stains, and weathering.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Retention:</strong> Helps maintain the original color of the grout over time, preventing fading or discoloration.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Application:</strong> Compatible with various types of cement-based grouts, allowing for use in a wide range of tiling applications, including floors, walls, and countertops.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Bathrooms and Wet Areas:</strong> Ideal for use in areas with high moisture exposure, such as showers, bathtubs, and bathroom floors.</li>\n	<li><strong>Kitchens:</strong> Enhances grout performance in areas subjected to spills, stains, and frequent cleaning.</li>\n	<li><strong>Outdoor Tiling:</strong> Suitable for outdoor installations, providing protection against the elements and temperature fluctuations.</li>\n	<li><strong>High-Traffic Areas:</strong> Perfect for commercial or residential spaces that experience heavy foot traffic, such as hallways, lobbies, and entryways.</li>\n	<li><strong>Swimming Pools:</strong> Provides waterproofing and durability in pool grout joints, ensuring long-lasting performance.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Preparation:</strong> Ensure that all surfaces are clean, dry, and free from contaminants. Follow the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions for preparing the cement-based grout.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Replace the water typically used in grout preparation with Myk-L 1776 Grout Admix Plus. Mix thoroughly until a smooth, homogeneous consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed grout using standard techniques, such as a rubber float, ensuring that grout joints are fully filled.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the grout to cure according to the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions. The addition of Myk-L 1776 may slightly extend the curing time, but it significantly improves the overall performance.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Conditions:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and freezing conditions.</li>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Ensure that the container is tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and maintain product effectiveness.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Precautions:</strong> Use personal protective equipment such as gloves and goggles during mixing and application. Ensure adequate ventilation in the working area.</li>\n	<li><strong>Handling:</strong> Avoid contact with skin and eyes. In case of accidental contact, rinse thoroughly with water and seek medical attention if necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Packaging Size:</strong> Typically available in various sizes depending on project needs.</li>\n	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Designed to be used with cement-based grouts.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Myk-L 1776 Grout Admix Plus</strong> is an essential product for professionals and DIY enthusiasts looking to achieve high-quality, durable, and aesthetically pleasing grout joints. Its advanced formulation enhances the flexibility, adhesion, and water resistance of grout, ensuring a long-lasting and beautiful finish in any tiling project.</p>\n\n<p><button></button><button id=\"radix-:rqe:\"></button></p>', '<p><strong>Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow</strong> is a premium-grade construction filler powder designed to enhance the performance and aesthetic of building materials. Here&rsquo;s a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow is a high-quality, finely ground filler powder available in a sophisticated silver shadow color. It is formulated to improve the workability, strength, and visual appeal of mortars, plasters, and concrete, making it suitable for both functional and decorative applications.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Silver shadow, providing a sleek and modern metallic grey finish that adds an elegant touch to various surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Composition:</strong> Crafted from high-grade raw materials to ensure consistent performance and durability in construction applications.</li>\n	<li><strong>Enhanced Workability:</strong> Improves the ease of mixing, handling, and application of construction materials, resulting in a smoother and more even finish.</li>\n	<li><strong>Increased Strength:</strong> Contributes to higher compressive and tensile strength in concrete and mortar, enhancing overall structural integrity.</li>\n	<li><strong>Reduced Shrinkage:</strong> Minimizes shrinkage during the curing process, helping to prevent cracks and surface imperfections.</li>\n	<li><strong>Excellent Adhesion:</strong> Enhances bonding to a range of substrates, ensuring long-lasting performance and stability.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Compatibility:</strong> Compatible with different types of cements and other construction materials, providing flexibility in various applications.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Mortars:</strong> Ideal for improving the properties of masonry mortars, offering both enhanced strength and a refined appearance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Plasters:</strong> Suitable for achieving a smooth and durable plaster finish with a stylish metallic grey tone.</li>\n	<li><strong>Concrete:</strong> Enhances the performance and visual appeal of concrete mixes, making it suitable for both structural and decorative purposes.</li>\n	<li><strong>Repairs:</strong> Effective for filling gaps, cracks, and other imperfections, delivering a high-quality and aesthetically pleasing finish.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Add Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow to the mix in the recommended proportions specified by the manufacturer. Mix thoroughly until a uniform consistency and color are achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ensure the surface to be filled or repaired is clean, dry, and free of loose material. Apply the mixed filler using standard construction techniques.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the filler to cure according to the manufacturer&#39;s instructions to achieve optimal strength and finish.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Conditions:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture to prevent premature hardening.</li>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Keep the product sealed in its original packaging when not in use to maintain its quality and effectiveness.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Precautions:</strong> Follow standard safety practices, including wearing protective gloves and eyewear. Ensure adequate ventilation during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Handling:</strong> Avoid inhalation and contact with skin. In case of accidental contact, rinse thoroughly with water and seek medical advice if necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Myk Filler Powder Silver Shadow</strong> offers a reliable and stylish solution for various construction and repair tasks, combining high performance with an attractive finish to meet both functional and aesthetic needs.<button></button></p>\n\n<p><strong>Myk-L 1776 Grout Admix Plus</strong> is a premium latex admixture designed to enhance the performance and durability of cement-based grouts. It is specifically formulated to improve the flexibility, adhesion, and water resistance of grouts, making it an essential addition for both residential and commercial tiling projects. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk-L 1776 Grout Admix Plus is a high-performance latex additive that, when mixed with cement-based grout, significantly improves its overall properties. This product is ideal for enhancing the longevity and appearance of grout joints, especially in areas exposed to moisture, temperature fluctuations, and heavy traffic.</p>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000048/jceghK4knJ_20240831192958.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1292;s:6:\"height\";i:1292;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000048/jceghK4knJ_20240831192958.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:969;s:6:\"height\";d:969;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000048/jceghK4knJ_20240831192958_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:646;s:6:\"height\";d:646;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000048/jceghK4knJ_20240831192958_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:323;s:6:\"height\";d:323;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000048/jceghK4knJ_20240831192958_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 11:12:20', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 14:00:19', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000049', 'myk-l315w-plus-white20kg', 'Myk L315w Plus White(20kg)', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/HJdljt1GHhc?si=ZFi2E7DRqdhYrfqJ', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000049/196eaaface5b5b8659787e5132fe5d21.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 500, 550, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk L315w Plus White (20kg)</strong> is a high-performance, polymer-modified, white cement-based adhesive designed for the installation of various types of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, and natural stone. This versatile adhesive is formulated to provide strong bonding, excellent flexibility, and superior durability, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor applications. Here&rsquo;s a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk L315w Plus White is a premium tile adhesive available in a 20kg package, specifically engineered to deliver exceptional performance in demanding tiling projects. Its white color makes it especially suitable for light-colored or translucent tiles, ensuring a clean, aesthetic finish without any discoloration.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Strong Bonding:</strong> Offers superior adhesion to a wide variety of substrates, including concrete, cement screeds, plaster, and drywall, ensuring that tiles stay firmly in place over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Enhanced Flexibility:</strong> Formulated to accommodate slight movements in the substrate, reducing the risk of tile cracking or debonding, even in areas subject to thermal expansion and contraction.</li>\n	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> Provides excellent water resistance, making it suitable for wet areas such as bathrooms, kitchens, and swimming pools.</li>\n	<li><strong>Stain Resistance:</strong> The white cement base helps prevent staining and discoloration of light-colored or translucent tiles.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Application:</strong> Easy to mix and apply, allowing for a smooth, even spread and making it suitable for large-scale tiling projects.</li>\n	<li><strong>Extended Open Time:</strong> Offers an extended open time for adjustments, providing flexibility during installation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Wall and Floor Tiling:</strong> Ideal for installing ceramic, porcelain, and natural stone tiles on both walls and floors.</li>\n	<li><strong>Wet Areas:</strong> Perfect for bathrooms, kitchens, and other areas exposed to moisture, where a water-resistant adhesive is crucial.</li>\n	<li><strong>Exterior and Interior Use:</strong> Suitable for both indoor and outdoor applications, including terraces, balconies, and facades.</li>\n	<li><strong>Light-Colored or Translucent Tiles:</strong> The white color of the adhesive is especially beneficial for use with light-colored or translucent tiles to maintain aesthetic integrity.</li>\n</ul>', '<p><strong>Myk L315w Plus White (20kg)</strong> is a high-performance, polymer-modified, white cement-based adhesive designed for the installation of various types of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, and natural stone. This versatile adhesive is formulated to provide strong bonding, excellent flexibility, and superior durability, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor applications. Here&rsquo;s a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk L315w Plus White is a premium tile adhesive available in a 20kg package, specifically engineered to deliver exceptional performance in demanding tiling projects. Its white color makes it especially suitable for light-colored or translucent tiles, ensuring a clean, aesthetic finish without any discoloration.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Strong Bonding:</strong> Offers superior adhesion to a wide variety of substrates, including concrete, cement screeds, plaster, and drywall, ensuring that tiles stay firmly in place over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Enhanced Flexibility:</strong> Formulated to accommodate slight movements in the substrate, reducing the risk of tile cracking or debonding, even in areas subject to thermal expansion and contraction.</li>\n	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> Provides excellent water resistance, making it suitable for wet areas such as bathrooms, kitchens, and swimming pools.</li>\n	<li><strong>Stain Resistance:</strong> The white cement base helps prevent staining and discoloration of light-colored or translucent tiles.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Application:</strong> Easy to mix and apply, allowing for a smooth, even spread and making it suitable for large-scale tiling projects.</li>\n	<li><strong>Extended Open Time:</strong> Offers an extended open time for adjustments, providing flexibility during installation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Wall and Floor Tiling:</strong> Ideal for installing ceramic, porcelain, and natural stone tiles on both walls and floors.</li>\n	<li><strong>Wet Areas:</strong> Perfect for bathrooms, kitchens, and other areas exposed to moisture, where a water-resistant adhesive is crucial.</li>\n	<li><strong>Exterior and Interior Use:</strong> Suitable for both indoor and outdoor applications, including terraces, balconies, and facades.</li>\n	<li><strong>Light-Colored or Translucent Tiles:</strong> The white color of the adhesive is especially beneficial for use with light-colored or translucent tiles to maintain aesthetic integrity.</li>\n</ul>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000049/ARRhbWsegt_20240831174203.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1001;s:6:\"height\";i:1001;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000049/ARRhbWsegt_20240831174203.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:750.75;s:6:\"height\";d:750.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000049/ARRhbWsegt_20240831174203_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:500.5;s:6:\"height\";d:500.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000049/ARRhbWsegt_20240831174203_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:250.25;s:6:\"height\";d:250.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000049/ARRhbWsegt_20240831174203_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 11:30:08', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:13:11', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000050', 'myk-sp-100ab-resin-kit-125kg', 'Myk SP 100AB Resin Kit 1.25kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000050/1eebf9cff8ee52f889fa2307324cc3df.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 2500, 2200, 'auto', '<h3><strong>Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Conditions:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and moisture.</li>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Ensure containers are tightly sealed when not in use to prevent contamination and premature curing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Precautions:</strong> Wear protective gloves, goggles, and appropriate clothing during mixing and application. Ensure adequate ventilation in the working area.</li>\n	<li><strong>Handling:</strong> Avoid contact with skin and eyes. In case of accidental contact, rinse thoroughly with water and seek medical attention if necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Packaging Size:</strong> Available in various sizes to meet project needs.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing Ratio:</strong> As specified by the manufacturer.</li>\n	<li><strong>Pot Life:</strong> The workable time after mixing, which can vary depending on environmental conditions.</li>\n	<li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Depends on the application method and surface conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Myk SP 100AB Resin Kit</strong> is an excellent choice for those seeking a reliable, high-performance epoxy resin system that offers outstanding durability, chemical resistance, and a smooth, glossy finish. Whether for industrial flooring, residential projects, or protective coatings, this resin kit delivers professional results that stand the test of time.<button><br />\n</button><button></button><button id=\"radix-:rrh:\"></button></p>', '<p><strong>Myk SP 100AB Resin Kit</strong> is a high-performance, two-component epoxy resin system designed for a variety of applications, including flooring, coatings, and repairs. This resin kit is engineered to provide exceptional durability, chemical resistance, and a flawless finish, making it suitable for both industrial and residential environments. Here&rsquo;s a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Myk SP 100AB Resin Kit is a versatile epoxy resin system consisting of Part A (resin) and Part B (hardener). When mixed, these components create a strong, durable, and glossy surface that is resistant to wear, chemicals, and moisture. The kit is ideal for creating seamless floors, protective coatings, and for use in various repair and construction applications.</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>High Durability:</strong> Provides a tough, long-lasting surface that can withstand heavy traffic, abrasion, and impact, making it ideal for industrial floors and other high-stress areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance:</strong> Excellent resistance to a wide range of chemicals, including oils, solvents, and acids, ensuring longevity in harsh environments.</li>\n	<li><strong>Moisture Resistance:</strong> Offers superior protection against moisture penetration, making it suitable for wet areas such as bathrooms, kitchens, and basements.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth, Glossy Finish:</strong> Cures to a smooth, glossy surface that enhances the aesthetic appeal of floors and surfaces, with excellent clarity and color retention.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Application:</strong> The resin kit is easy to mix and apply, with a workable pot life that allows for precise application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Suitable for a variety of applications, including flooring, wall coatings, protective coatings, and repair work.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Industrial Flooring:</strong> Ideal for creating seamless, durable floors in warehouses, factories, garages, and other industrial settings.</li>\n	<li><strong>Residential Flooring:</strong> Suitable for use in homes, particularly in areas like kitchens, bathrooms, and basements where durability and moisture resistance are important.</li>\n	<li><strong>Protective Coatings:</strong> Provides a protective layer for concrete, wood, metal, and other surfaces, preventing damage from chemicals, moisture, and abrasion.</li>\n	<li><strong>Repairs:</strong> Effective for repairing cracks, holes, and other surface imperfections, providing a strong, long-lasting bond.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Ensure the surface is clean, dry, and free from dust, oil, grease, or any loose material. Roughen smooth surfaces to improve adhesion.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine Part A (resin) and Part B (hardener) in the specified ratio provided by the manufacturer. Mix thoroughly until a uniform consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Apply the mixed resin using a roller, brush, or trowel, depending on the application. For flooring, spread evenly across the surface, ensuring a consistent layer.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the resin to cure as per the manufacturer&rsquo;s guidelines. Curing times may vary based on temperature, humidity, and other environmental factors.</li>\n	<li><strong>Finishing:</strong> Once cured, the surface can be sanded, polished, or coated with additional layers if required.</li>\n</ol>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000050/bE57Fp5f7R_20240831175505.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000050/bE57Fp5f7R_20240831175505.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000050/bE57Fp5f7R_20240831175505_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000050/bE57Fp5f7R_20240831175505_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000050/bE57Fp5f7R_20240831175505_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 11:34:10', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:27:47', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000051', 'myk-sp-100-filler-skyblue-375kg', 'Myk SP 100 Filler Skyblue 3.75kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000051/b9dfa49c17d161dc738e01e10dc8a04d.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 1300, 1000, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk Laticrete SP-100 Filler Sky Blue</strong> is a premium epoxy-based grout designed for filling tile joints. Known for its vibrant Sky Blue color, this grout offers several key benefits:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Stain Resistance</strong>: Protects against common stains, ensuring long-lasting color and appearance.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durability</strong>: Provides strong, flexible joints that resist cracking and shrinking.</li>\n	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: Withstands exposure to harsh chemicals, making it ideal for various settings, including kitchens, bathrooms, and industrial areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Waterproof</strong>: Perfect for wet areas, preventing water penetration.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish</strong>: Easy to apply, offering a consistent, smooth finish that enhances the overall look of tiled surfaces.</li>\n</ul>', '<p><strong>Myk Laticrete SP-100 Filler Sky Blue 3.75kg</strong> is a high-performance, stain-resistant grout designed for filling gaps between tiles. It is commonly used in both residential and commercial settings for its durability and aesthetic appeal. Here&rsquo;s a brief description:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color</strong>: Sky Blue</li>\n	<li><strong>Weight</strong>: 3.75 kg</li>\n	<li><strong>Type</strong>: Epoxy grout filler</li>\n	<li><strong>Usage</strong>: Suitable for joint filling in tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, and natural stone. Ideal for areas prone to staining, such as kitchens, bathrooms, and high-traffic areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Features</strong>:\n	<ul>\n		<li><strong>Stain-resistant</strong>: Protects against common household stains.</li>\n		<li><strong>Chemical-resistant</strong>: Offers protection against chemicals, making it ideal for industrial applications.</li>\n		<li><strong>Easy to apply</strong>: Smooth texture for easy application.</li>\n		<li><strong>Waterproof</strong>: Ensures no water seepage, making it perfect for wet areas.</li>\n		<li><strong>Durable</strong>: High strength and long-lasting finish.</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This product is widely appreciated for its vibrant color options and reliable performance in different environments.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000051/UsEPNCtD92_20240831175056.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000051/UsEPNCtD92_20240831175056.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000051/UsEPNCtD92_20240831175056_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000051/UsEPNCtD92_20240831175056_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000051/UsEPNCtD92_20240831175056_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 11:46:05', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:21:37', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000052', 'myk-sp100-filler-skyblue-375kg', 'Myk Sp-100 Filler Skyblue -3.75kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000052/965fc0befd24fcc6e89c5918be6d2b70.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 1300, 1000, 'auto', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk Laticrete</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> SP-100 Filler</li>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Sky Blue</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Epoxy grout filler</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Stain Resistance:</strong> The epoxy formulation ensures exceptional resistance to stains, protecting grout joints from discoloration caused by everyday spills like coffee, tea, oil, and wine.</li>\n	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance:</strong> Designed to withstand exposure to harsh chemicals, making it suitable for use in industrial environments and areas that require regular cleaning with strong agents.</li>\n	<li><strong>Waterproof:</strong> This grout is completely impermeable to water, making it an excellent choice for wet areas such as bathrooms, showers, swimming pools, and kitchens. It prevents water penetration and reduces the risk of mold and mildew growth.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> The grout offers high bond strength and flexibility, ensuring long-lasting performance. It resists cracking, shrinking, and crumbling, maintaining the integrity of the tile installation over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Provides a smooth, uniform finish that enhances the aesthetic appeal of tiled surfaces. The Sky Blue color is vibrant and stable, resisting fading over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Maintenance:</strong> The grout&#39;s smooth surface is easy to clean and maintain, reducing the need for frequent upkeep. It is resistant to mold, mildew, and dirt buildup.</li>\n	<li><strong>Non-Shrinkage:</strong> The non-shrink formula ensures that the grout joints remain consistent in width, preventing gaps or uneven surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Application:</strong> Suitable for use with various types of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, glass, and natural stone. It can be applied in both interior and exterior settings.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Ideal for kitchens, bathrooms, living rooms, balconies, and outdoor patios.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Suitable for high-traffic areas such as malls, hospitals, offices, hotels, and restaurants.</li>\n	<li><strong>Industrial:</strong> Perfect for laboratories, factories, and other environments where chemical resistance and durability are crucial.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Ensure the tile joints are clean, dry, and free of dust, grease, or other contaminants.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Mix the grout components as per the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions until a homogeneous consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Use a rubber float or squeegee to apply the grout, pressing it firmly into the joints. Wipe off excess grout from the tile surface before it begins to set.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the grout to cure according to the manufacturer&rsquo;s recommended time before exposing it to water, traffic, or chemicals.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Packaging and Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> The grout is available in a 3.75 kg container, which is sufficient for covering a significant area depending on tile size and joint width.</li>\n	<li><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Ensure the container is tightly sealed when not in use to maintain the product&rsquo;s quality.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety Precautions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Protective Gear:</strong> Always wear gloves, masks, and eye protection during application to avoid contact with skin and eyes.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ventilation:</strong> Ensure proper ventilation in the working area to avoid inhalation of fumes.</li>\n	<li><strong>First Aid:</strong> In case of contact with skin or eyes, rinse immediately with plenty of water and seek medical attention if necessary.</li>\n</ul>', '<p><strong>Myk SP-100 Filler Sky Blue</strong> is a high-performance, epoxy-based grout designed for filling tile joints. It features a vibrant Sky Blue color and is known for its exceptional durability and aesthetic appeal. Key features include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Stain Resistance</strong>: Protects against common stains, keeping the grout looking fresh and clean.</li>\n	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: Suitable for areas exposed to chemicals, maintaining its integrity and color.</li>\n	<li><strong>Waterproof</strong>: Ideal for wet areas like bathrooms and kitchens, preventing water seepage.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durable Finish</strong>: Offers a strong, flexible, and long-lasting finish that resists cracking.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Application</strong>: Provides a smooth and even finish, enhancing the overall appearance of tiled surfaces.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><br />\n<button id=\"radix-:rug:\"></button></p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000052/WgvmHJPrLP_20240831175906.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000052/WgvmHJPrLP_20240831175906.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000052/WgvmHJPrLP_20240831175906_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000052/WgvmHJPrLP_20240831175906_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000052/WgvmHJPrLP_20240831175906_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 11:53:29', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:29:34', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000053', 'myk-sp-100-resin-kit-025kg', 'Myk SP -100 Resin Kit 0.25Kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000053/8727100205326cad8ac2c564133d861e.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 850, 550, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk SP-100 Resin Kit</strong> is a specialized product designed for use in conjunction with Myk SP-100 Filler. This resin kit is an essential component in the preparation of epoxy grout, providing the necessary adhesive and binding properties that ensure the grout&#39;s durability, stain resistance, and overall performance. Here&rsquo;s a description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk Laticrete</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> SP-100 Resin Kit</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Epoxy resin</li>\n	<li><strong>Components:</strong> Typically includes a resin (part A) and a hardener (part B) that must be mixed together.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>High Adhesive Strength:</strong> Provides excellent bonding to a wide variety of substrates, ensuring the grout adheres firmly to the tiles and joints.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> The resin mixture cures to form a hard, durable surface that resists wear, cracking, and shrinkage, maintaining the integrity of the tiled surface over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Stain Resistance:</strong> When mixed with SP-100 Filler, the resin contributes to the grout&rsquo;s ability to resist stains from common substances like oils, grease, and food spills.</li>\n	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance:</strong> The cured epoxy grout is highly resistant to chemicals, making it suitable for use in environments exposed to harsh substances.</li>\n	<li><strong>Waterproof:</strong> Once cured, the resin provides a waterproof barrier, preventing moisture from penetrating the grout and underlying layers, ideal for wet areas such as bathrooms, kitchens, and swimming pools.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Mixing:</strong> The resin and hardener are designed to be mixed easily, creating a smooth, workable mixture that can be applied with precision.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Kitchens, bathrooms, and other tiled areas that require strong, durable, and stain-resistant grout.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Ideal for high-traffic areas such as shopping malls, restaurants, hotels, and office buildings.</li>\n	<li><strong>Industrial:</strong> Suitable for use in factories, laboratories, and other environments where chemical resistance and durability are crucial.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the resin (part A) and hardener (part B) according to the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions, ensuring they are mixed thoroughly to achieve a uniform consistency.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Once mixed, the resin should be combined with the Myk SP-100 Filler and applied to the tile joints using appropriate tools such as a rubber float.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the mixed resin and filler to cure according to the recommended time before exposing the area to water, traffic, or chemicals.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Packaging and Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> The resin kit is typically available in containers suitable for the specified amount of grout needed. It may be packaged in separate containers for the resin and hardener.</li>\n	<li><strong>Storage:</strong> Store the resin kit in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight. Ensure that containers are tightly sealed when not in use to preserve the quality of the product.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety Precautions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Protective Gear:</strong> Wear gloves, goggles, and protective clothing during mixing and application to avoid skin and eye contact.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ventilation:</strong> Ensure adequate ventilation in the work area to avoid inhaling fumes from the resin and hardener.</li>\n	<li><strong>First Aid:</strong> In case of contact with skin or eyes, rinse immediately with plenty of water. If ingested or inhaled, seek medical attention promptly.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Environmental Considerations:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Eco-Friendly:</strong> Formulated with low VOC content to minimize environmental impact and ensure safety during indoor use.</li>\n	<li><strong>Disposal:</strong> Dispose of any unused resin, hardener, and empty containers in accordance with local environmental regulations.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The <strong>Myk SP-100 Resin Kit</strong> is a crucial component for creating high-quality, durable, and aesthetically pleasing epoxy grout that meets the demands of various tiling applications.<button><br />\n</button><button></button><button id=\"radix-:rvh:\"></button></p>', '<p><strong>Myk SP-100 Resin Kit</strong> is a specialized product designed for use in conjunction with Myk SP-100 Filler. This resin kit is an essential component in the preparation of epoxy grout, providing the necessary adhesive and binding properties that ensure the grout&#39;s durability, stain resistance, and overall performance. Here&rsquo;s a description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk Laticrete</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> SP-100 Resin Kit</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Epoxy resin</li>\n	<li><strong>Components:</strong> Typically includes a resin (part A) and a hardener (part B) that must be mixed together.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>High Adhesive Strength:</strong> Provides excellent bonding to a wide variety of substrates, ensuring the grout adheres firmly to the tiles and joints.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> The resin mixture cures to form a hard, durable surface that resists wear, cracking, and shrinkage, maintaining the integrity of the tiled surface over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Stain Resistance:</strong> When mixed with SP-100 Filler, the resin contributes to the grout&rsquo;s ability to resist stains from common substances like oils, grease, and food spills.</li>\n	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance:</strong> The cured epoxy grout is highly resistant to chemicals, making it suitable for use in environments exposed to harsh substances.</li>\n	<li><strong>Waterproof:</strong> Once cured, the resin provides a waterproof barrier, preventing moisture from penetrating the grout and underlying layers, ideal for wet areas such as bathrooms, kitchens, and swimming pools.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Mixing:</strong> The resin and hardener are designed to be mixed easily, creating a smooth, workable mixture that can be applied with precision.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Kitchens, bathrooms, and other tiled areas that require strong, durable, and stain-resistant grout.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Ideal for high-traffic areas such as shopping malls, restaurants, hotels, and office buildings.</li>\n	<li><strong>Industrial:</strong> Suitable for use in factories, laboratories, and other environments where chemical resistance and durability are crucial.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the resin (part A) and hardener (part B) according to the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions, ensuring they are mixed thoroughly to achieve a uniform consistency.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Once mixed, the resin should be combined with the Myk SP-100 Filler and applied to the tile joints using appropriate tools such as a rubber float.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the mixed resin and filler to cure according to the recommended time before exposing the area to water, traffic, or chemicals.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Packaging and Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> The resin kit is typically available in containers suitable for the specified amount of grout needed. It may be packaged in separate containers for the resin and hardener.</li>\n	<li><strong>Storage:</strong> Store the resin kit in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight. Ensure that containers are tightly sealed when not in use to preserve the quality of the product.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Safety Precautions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Protective Gear:</strong> Wear gloves, goggles, and protective clothing during mixing and application to avoid skin and eye contact.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ventilation:</strong> Ensure adequate ventilation in the work area to avoid inhaling fumes from the resin and hardener.</li>\n	<li><strong>First Aid:</strong> In case of contact with skin or eyes, rinse immediately with plenty of water. If ingested or inhaled, seek medical attention promptly.</li>\n</ul>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000053/rYI8g8sr4t_20240831174348.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:832;s:6:\"height\";i:832;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000053/rYI8g8sr4t_20240831174348.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:624;s:6:\"height\";d:624;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000053/rYI8g8sr4t_20240831174348_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:416;s:6:\"height\";d:416;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000053/rYI8g8sr4t_20240831174348_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:208;s:6:\"height\";d:208;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000053/rYI8g8sr4t_20240831174348_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 12:02:59', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:15:34', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000054', 'myk-spacers-2mm-100n', 'Myk Spacers 2mm 100N', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', '', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 120, 90, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk Spacers 2mm 100N</strong> are precision-engineered tile spacers designed to ensure consistent spacing between tiles during installation. These spacers are essential for achieving uniform grout lines, which contribute to the overall aesthetic and structural integrity of tiled surfaces. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Spacers 2mm</li>\n	<li><strong>Size:</strong> 2 mm</li>\n	<li><strong>Quantity:</strong> 100 pieces (100N)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Uniform Spacing:</strong> The spacers are precisely molded to maintain a consistent 2mm gap between tiles, ensuring even grout lines across the entire surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durable Material:</strong> Made from high-quality, durable plastic, these spacers are strong enough to withstand the pressure of tile setting and ensure a perfect alignment without bending or breaking.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ease of Use:</strong> The spacers are easy to insert and remove, making the tiling process quicker and more efficient. They are suitable for use by both professionals and DIY enthusiasts.</li>\n	<li><strong>Reusable:</strong> Depending on the project and care taken during removal, these spacers can often be reused, adding to their cost-effectiveness.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Application:</strong> Ideal for use with various types of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, glass, and natural stone. They are suitable for wall and floor installations in residential and commercial spaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Helps achieve a professional-looking finish by ensuring tiles are perfectly aligned, reducing the need for corrections after installation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Perfect for bathrooms, kitchens, living rooms, and other tiled areas where consistent grout lines are desired.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Suitable for large-scale tiling projects in hotels, restaurants, offices, and shopping centers.</li>\n	<li><strong>DIY Projects:</strong> Ideal for home improvement enthusiasts working on small to medium-sized tiling projects.</li>\n</ul>', '<p><strong>Myk Spacers 2mm 100N</strong> are precision-engineered tile spacers designed to ensure consistent spacing between tiles during installation. These spacers are essential for achieving uniform grout lines, which contribute to the overall aesthetic and structural integrity of tiled surfaces. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Spacers 2mm</li>\n	<li><strong>Size:</strong> 2 mm</li>\n	<li><strong>Quantity:</strong> 100 pieces (100N)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Uniform Spacing:</strong> The spacers are precisely molded to maintain a consistent 2mm gap between tiles, ensuring even grout lines across the entire surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durable Material:</strong> Made from high-quality, durable plastic, these spacers are strong enough to withstand the pressure of tile setting and ensure a perfect alignment without bending or breaking.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ease of Use:</strong> The spacers are easy to insert and remove, making the tiling process quicker and more efficient. They are suitable for use by both professionals and DIY enthusiasts.</li>\n	<li><strong>Reusable:</strong> Depending on the project and care taken during removal, these spacers can often be reused, adding to their cost-effectiveness.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Application:</strong> Ideal for use with various types of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, glass, and natural stone. They are suitable for wall and floor installations in residential and commercial spaces.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000054/BDe6jUjAgy_20240831181349.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:1064;s:6:\"height\";i:1064;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000054/BDe6jUjAgy_20240831181349.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:798;s:6:\"height\";d:798;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000054/BDe6jUjAgy_20240831181349_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:532;s:6:\"height\";d:532;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000054/BDe6jUjAgy_20240831181349_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:266;s:6:\"height\";d:266;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000054/BDe6jUjAgy_20240831181349_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 12:05:26', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:48:19', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tbl_products` (`ProductID`, `Slug`, `ProductName`, `ProductType`, `ProductCode`, `Stages`, `VideoURL`, `ProductBrochure`, `HSNSAC`, `CID`, `SCID`, `UID`, `MinQty`, `MaxQty`, `RelatedProducts`, `TaxType`, `TaxID`, `PRate`, `SRate`, `Decimals`, `Description`, `ShortDescription`, `Attributes`, `ProductImage`, `Images`, `ActiveStatus`, `DFlag`, `CreatedOn`, `CreatedBy`, `UpdatedOn`, `UpdatedBy`, `DeletedOn`, `DeletedBy`) VALUES
('P2425-0000055', 'myk-unsanded-grout-1kg', 'Myk Unsanded Grout 1kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000055/0df9146a76ce4513e4e696c2e007b343.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 130, 90, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout 1kg</strong> is a high-quality, cement-based grout designed for filling narrow joints between tiles. It is specifically formulated for use with delicate tile surfaces and in areas where a smooth, fine finish is desired. This grout is ideal for both residential and commercial tiling projects. Below is a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Unsanded Grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 1 kg</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Cement-based, unsanded grout</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The unsanded formulation provides a smooth, fine finish that is ideal for narrow grout lines, typically 1/8 inch (3mm) or less. This makes it perfect for delicate surfaces like polished marble, glass tiles, and other materials that could be scratched by sanded grout.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ease of Application:</strong> The fine texture of the grout allows for easy application and ensures the grout fills even the smallest joints evenly, without leaving gaps or voids.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> Formulated to deliver consistent color throughout the application, ensuring an even, professional-looking finish that enhances the overall appearance of the tiled surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Resistance:</strong> Engineered to minimize shrinkage as it cures, which helps maintain the integrity of the grout lines and prevents cracks.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold and Mildew Resistant:</strong> Contains additives that inhibit the growth of mold and mildew, making it an excellent choice for moisture-prone areas such as bathrooms and kitchens.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> Offers a strong and durable bond between tiles, ensuring that the grout lines remain intact over time, even in high-traffic areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Suitable for use with a wide range of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, marble, and glass. It is ideal for both wall and floor installations.</li>\n	<li><strong>Low Maintenance:</strong> The smooth, non-porous surface of the grout is easy to clean and maintain, reducing the frequency of necessary upkeep.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Ideal for bathrooms, kitchens, backsplashes, and other indoor areas where narrow grout lines are desired.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Suitable for tiling projects in hotels, restaurants, offices, and other high-traffic commercial spaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>DIY Projects:</strong> Perfect for home improvement enthusiasts working on small to medium-sized tiling projects where a fine finish is essential.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Ensure that the tile joints are clean, dry, and free of any dust, debris, or old grout.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Mix the grout powder with water according to the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions, typically until a smooth, creamy consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Use a rubber float to apply the grout into the joints, pressing it firmly to ensure full coverage. Remove excess grout from the tile surface using a damp sponge before it sets.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the grout to cure as per the recommended time, usually 24-48 hours, before exposing the surface to water or heavy use.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong>Packaging and Storage:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Packaging:</strong> The grout is available in a 1 kg bag, suitable for small to medium-sized tiling projects.</li>\n	<li><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place away from moisture and direct sunlight. The bag should be tightly sealed when not in use to maintain the product&rsquo;s quality.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout 1kg</strong> is a high-quality, cement-based grout designed for filling narrow joints between tiles. It is specifically formulated for use with delicate tile surfaces and in areas where a smooth, fine finish is desired. This grout is ideal for both residential and commercial tiling projects. Below is a comprehensive description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Unsanded Grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 1 kg</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Cement-based, unsanded grout</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The unsanded formulation provides a smooth, fine finish that is ideal for narrow grout lines, typically 1/8 inch (3mm) or less. This makes it perfect for delicate surfaces like polished marble, glass tiles, and other materials that could be scratched by sanded grout.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ease of Application:</strong> The fine texture of the grout allows for easy application and ensures the grout fills even the smallest joints evenly, without leaving gaps or voids.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> Formulated to deliver consistent color throughout the application, ensuring an even, professional-looking finish that enhances the overall appearance of the tiled surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Resistance:</strong> Engineered to minimize shrinkage as it cures, which helps maintain the integrity of the grout lines and prevents cracks.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold and Mildew Resistant:</strong> Contains additives that inhibit the growth of mold and mildew, making it an excellent choice for moisture-prone areas such as bathrooms and kitchens.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> Offers a strong and durable bond between tiles, ensuring that the grout lines remain intact over time, even in high-traffic areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Suitable for use with a wide range of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, marble, and glass. It is ideal for both wall and floor installations.</li>\n	<li><strong>Low Maintenance:</strong> The smooth, non-porous surface of the grout is easy to clean and maintain, reducing the frequency of necessary upkeep.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Ideal for bathrooms, kitchens, backsplashes, and other indoor areas where narrow grout lines are desired.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Suitable for tiling projects in hotels, restaurants, offices, and other high-traffic commercial spaces.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000055/n95Qpjt4UU_20240831190835.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:864;s:6:\"height\";i:864;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000055/n95Qpjt4UU_20240831190835.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:648;s:6:\"height\";d:648;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000055/n95Qpjt4UU_20240831190835_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:432;s:6:\"height\";d:432;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000055/n95Qpjt4UU_20240831190835_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:216;s:6:\"height\";d:216;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000055/n95Qpjt4UU_20240831190835_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 12:10:48', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 13:39:36', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000056', 'myk-unsanded-grout-688silver-shadow-1kg', 'Myk Unsanded Grout 688(Silver shadow 1kg)', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', '', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 130, 90, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout 688 (Silver Shadow 1kg)</strong> is a premium, cement-based grout designed for filling narrow joints between tiles. The Silver Shadow color provides a sleek, subtle finish that complements a wide range of tile designs, making it a popular choice for both residential and commercial projects. Here&rsquo;s a full description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Unsanded Grout 688</li>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Silver Shadow (Shade 688)</li>\n	<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 1 kg</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Cement-based, unsanded grout</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The unsanded formula is ideal for joints less than 1/8 inch (3mm) wide. It provides a smooth, fine texture that is perfect for delicate tiles like polished marble, glass, or porcelain, ensuring no scratching or damage occurs during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Silver Shadow Color:</strong> The Silver Shadow shade is a soft, neutral gray that complements various tile colors and styles, adding a contemporary and elegant touch to tiled surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> Formulated for consistent color throughout the application, ensuring a uniform, professional finish that enhances the overall appearance of the tiled surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Resistance:</strong> Designed to minimize shrinkage as it cures, helping to maintain the integrity of the grout lines and preventing cracks or gaps.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold and Mildew Resistance:</strong> Contains anti-microbial additives to resist mold and mildew growth, making it suitable for damp areas like bathrooms, kitchens, and other moisture-prone spaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durable Bond:</strong> Provides strong adhesion and durability, ensuring the grout lines remain intact even in high-traffic areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ease of Application:</strong> The fine, smooth texture of the grout allows for easy application, ensuring that even the smallest joints are completely filled without any voids.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for a wide range of tile materials, including ceramic, porcelain, glass, and natural stone. It can be used on both walls and floors in various settings.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Ideal for bathrooms, kitchens, backsplashes, and other tiled areas where a smooth, refined finish is desired.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Suitable for high-traffic areas in hotels, restaurants, offices, and other commercial environments.</li>\n	<li><strong>DIY Projects:</strong> Perfect for homeowners working on tiling projects where precision and a high-quality finish are important.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout 688 (Silver Shadow 1kg)</strong> is a premium, cement-based grout designed for filling narrow joints between tiles. The Silver Shadow color provides a sleek, subtle finish that complements a wide range of tile designs, making it a popular choice for both residential and commercial projects. Here&rsquo;s a full description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Unsanded Grout 688</li>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Silver Shadow (Shade 688)</li>\n	<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 1 kg</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Cement-based, unsanded grout</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The unsanded formula is ideal for joints less than 1/8 inch (3mm) wide. It provides a smooth, fine texture that is perfect for delicate tiles like polished marble, glass, or porcelain, ensuring no scratching or damage occurs during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Silver Shadow Color:</strong> The Silver Shadow shade is a soft, neutral gray that complements various tile colors and styles, adding a contemporary and elegant touch to tiled surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> Formulated for consistent color throughout the application, ensuring a uniform, professional finish that enhances the overall appearance of the tiled surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Resistance:</strong> Designed to minimize shrinkage as it cures, helping to maintain the integrity of the grout lines and preventing cracks or gaps.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold and Mildew Resistance:</strong> Contains anti-microbial additives to resist mold and mildew growth, making it suitable for damp areas like bathrooms, kitchens, and other moisture-prone spaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durable Bond:</strong> Provides strong adhesion and durability, ensuring the grout lines remain intact even in high-traffic areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ease of Application:</strong> The fine, smooth texture of the grout allows for easy application, ensuring that even the smallest joints are completely filled without any voids.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for a wide range of tile materials, including ceramic, porcelain, glass, and natural stone. It can be used on both walls and floors in various settings.</li>\n</ul>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000056/2ID06VAZ8n_20240831191050.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:785;s:6:\"height\";i:785;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000056/2ID06VAZ8n_20240831191050.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:588.75;s:6:\"height\";d:588.75;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000056/2ID06VAZ8n_20240831191050_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:392.5;s:6:\"height\";d:392.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000056/2ID06VAZ8n_20240831191050_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:196.25;s:6:\"height\";d:196.25;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000056/2ID06VAZ8n_20240831191050_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 12:15:48', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 13:41:08', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000057', 'myk-unsanded-grout-bright-white-1kg', 'Myk Unsanded Grout (Bright white 1kg)', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000057/610d164344448ed2c5e895f82a3be36f.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 130, 90, 'auto', '<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout</strong> is a high-performance, cement-based grout designed for filling narrow joints between tiles. It is formulated to provide a smooth, fine finish, making it an ideal choice for delicate surfaces and areas where a precise, aesthetically pleasing finish is required. This grout is suitable for a variety of residential and commercial tiling projects. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Unsanded Grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Cement-based, unsanded grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> For narrow grout joints (typically 1/8 inch or less)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The unsanded formula offers a smooth, fine texture, perfect for narrow joints and delicate tile surfaces such as polished marble, glass, and porcelain. This ensures the grout does not scratch or damage the tiles during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> Designed to provide consistent color throughout the application, ensuring a uniform and professional-looking finish across the entire tiled surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Resistance:</strong> The formulation minimizes shrinkage as the grout cures, helping to prevent cracks and maintain the integrity of the grout lines over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold and Mildew Resistance:</strong> The grout includes anti-microbial additives that help prevent the growth of mold and mildew, making it ideal for use in moisture-prone areas such as bathrooms and kitchens.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durable Bond:</strong> Provides strong adhesion to tiles, ensuring that the grout lines remain intact even in high-traffic areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Application:</strong> The grout&rsquo;s fine texture makes it easy to apply, allowing for full coverage of narrow joints without leaving gaps or voids.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for use with various types of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, glass, and natural stone. It can be used on both walls and floors in different settings.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Perfect for bathrooms, kitchens, backsplashes, and other areas where a smooth, refined finish is desired.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Suitable for high-traffic areas in hotels, restaurants, offices, and other commercial environments.</li>\n	<li><strong>DIY Projects:</strong> Ideal for homeowners working on tiling projects that require precision and a high-quality finish.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Instructions:</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Ensure that the tile joints are clean, dry, and free of any dust, debris, or old grout.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Combine the grout powder with water as per the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions, mixing until a smooth, creamy consistency is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Use a rubber float to apply the grout into the joints, pressing firmly to ensure full coverage. Remove excess grout from the tile surface using a damp sponge before it begins to set.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the grout to cure according to the recommended time, typically 24-48 hours, before exposing the surface to water, traffic, or cleaning</li>\n</ol>', '<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout</strong> is a high-performance, cement-based grout designed for filling narrow joints between tiles. It is formulated to provide a smooth, fine finish, making it an ideal choice for delicate surfaces and areas where a precise, aesthetically pleasing finish is required. This grout is suitable for a variety of residential and commercial tiling projects. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description:</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Unsanded Grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Cement-based, unsanded grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> For narrow grout joints (typically 1/8 inch or less)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> The unsanded formula offers a smooth, fine texture, perfect for narrow joints and delicate tile surfaces such as polished marble, glass, and porcelain. This ensures the grout does not scratch or damage the tiles during application.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> Designed to provide consistent color throughout the application, ensuring a uniform and professional-looking finish across the entire tiled surface.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shrinkage Resistance:</strong> The formulation minimizes shrinkage as the grout cures, helping to prevent cracks and maintain the integrity of the grout lines over time.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold and Mildew Resistance:</strong> The grout includes anti-microbial additives that help prevent the growth of mold and mildew, making it ideal for use in moisture-prone areas such as bathrooms and kitchens.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durable Bond:</strong> Provides strong adhesion to tiles, ensuring that the grout lines remain intact even in high-traffic areas.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Application:</strong> The grout&rsquo;s fine texture makes it easy to apply, allowing for full coverage of narrow joints without leaving gaps or voids.</li>\n	<li><strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for use with various types of tiles, including ceramic, porcelain, glass, and natural stone. It can be used on both walls and floors in different settings.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>Application Areas:</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Residential:</strong> Perfect for bathrooms, kitchens, backsplashes, and other areas where a smooth, refined finish is desired.</li>\n	<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> Suitable for high-traffic areas in hotels, restaurants, offices, and other commercial environments.</li>\n</ul>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000057/7GXxekisMr_20240831182126.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:864;s:6:\"height\";i:864;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000057/7GXxekisMr_20240831182126.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:648;s:6:\"height\";d:648;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000057/7GXxekisMr_20240831182126_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:432;s:6:\"height\";d:432;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000057/7GXxekisMr_20240831182126_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:216;s:6:\"height\";d:216;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000057/7GXxekisMr_20240831182126_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 12:21:04', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 12:52:53', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL),
('P2425-0000058', 'myk-unsanded-grout-marble-belge-1kg', 'Myk Unsanded Grout Marble Belge 1kg', 'Simple', NULL, 'a:1:{i:0;s:14:\"SG2024-0000003\";}', 'https://youtu.be/NEU8XSzZPhY?si=lIi3GhL304bd84BX', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000058/0aafe8969d2fde594c029a8dbe613f81.pdf', '3214', 'PC2024-0000008', 'PSC2425-0000019', 'UOM2023-0000004', 0, 0, 'N;', 'Include', 'TX2023-0000002', 130, 90, 'auto', '<p>Myk Unsanded Grout is a premium-quality grout specifically designed for delicate tile installations, such as marble, glass, and polished stone. Here&rsquo;s a detailed description of the <strong>Myk Unsanded Grout Marble Belge 1kg</strong>:</p>\n\n<h3>Product Description:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Myk</li>\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Unsanded Grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Marble Belge</li>\n	<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 1kg</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Non-Abrasive:</strong> Unsanded grout is ideal for use with soft or delicate tiles, such as marble, where a sanded grout might cause scratching.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Provides a smooth, even finish, which is particularly desirable for narrow grout joints (typically 1/8 inch or less).</li>\n	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> Formulated to resist water penetration, making it suitable for areas exposed to moisture, such as bathrooms and kitchens.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold &amp; Mildew Resistant:</strong> Contains additives that prevent the growth of mold and mildew, ensuring the longevity of the installation.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy to Apply:</strong> The grout mixes easily with water and applies smoothly, ensuring a hassle-free installation process.</li>\n	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> Once cured, the grout is strong and durable, providing long-lasting protection and stability for the tiles.</li>\n	<li><strong>Color Consistency:</strong> The Marble Belge color offers consistent coloring throughout the grout line, enhancing the overall aesthetic appeal.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Application:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Ideal for grouting joints in marble, glass, porcelain, and polished stone tiles.</li>\n	<li>Suitable for use in bathrooms, kitchens, and other areas where a smooth, non-scratch finish is desired.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Instructions:</h3>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>Surface Preparation:</strong> Ensure that the tiles are properly set and the joints are clean and free of debris.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing:</strong> Mix the grout with water according to the manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions until a smooth, consistent paste is achieved.</li>\n	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Using a grout float, apply the grout diagonally across the joints, pressing it firmly into the gaps.</li>\n	<li><strong>Cleaning:</strong> Once the grout starts to set (usually after a few minutes), use a damp sponge to wipe away excess grout from the tile surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Curing:</strong> Allow the grout to cure for the recommended time before exposing it to water or heavy use.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3>Packaging:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>The product comes in a 1kg package, sufficient for small to medium-sized tiling projects.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Safety:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Always wear protective gloves and a mask when mixing and applying grout to avoid irritation from dust and chemicals.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This grout is ideal for achieving a seamless and professional finish with delicate tiles, enhancing both the durability and aesthetics of your tile installation.<button></button><button></button></p>\n\n<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout Marble Belge</strong> is a high-quality, non-abrasive grout specifically designed for use with delicate tiles such as marble, glass, and polished stone. The unsanded formula ensures a smooth, scratch-free finish, making it ideal for narrow grout joints (typically 1/8 inch or less).</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Marble Belge</li>\n	<li><strong>Non-Abrasive:</strong> Safe for use on soft or polished surfaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Provides an even, aesthetically pleasing grout line.</li>\n	<li><strong>Water-Resistant:</strong> Suitable for wet areas like bathrooms and kitchens.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mold &amp; Mildew Resistant:</strong> Contains additives to prevent mold and mildew growth.</li>\n	<li><strong>Easy Application:</strong> Mixes easily with water and spreads smoothly for a hassle-free installation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This grout is perfect for achieving a consistent and durable finish in tile installations where preserving the integrity of delicate tiles is essential.<br />\n<button id=\"radix-:r147:\"></button></p>', '<p><strong>Myk Unsanded Grout Marble Belge 1kg</strong> is a specialized grout designed for use with marble and other delicate stone surfaces. Here&rsquo;s a brief description:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Type</strong>: Unsanded grout</li>\n	<li><strong>Color</strong>: Marble Belge (a subtle, beige hue)</li>\n	<li><strong>Weight</strong>: 1 kg</li>\n	<li><strong>Usage</strong>: Ideal for filling joints between tiles, especially for narrow joints (less than 1/8 inch) and delicate surfaces like marble.</li>\n	<li><strong>Benefits</strong>:\n	<ul>\n		<li>Non-scratch formula, making it safe for use on soft stones like marble.</li>\n		<li>Smooth finish, ensuring a clean and polished look.</li>\n		<li>Water-resistant once cured, helping to prevent water damage and staining.</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li><strong>Application</strong>: Suitable for interior use in areas such as bathrooms, kitchens, and other tiled spaces.</li>\n	<li><strong>Mixing</strong>: Requires water for mixing, and it is easy to apply with a grout float.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This grout is perfect for homeowners or professionals looking to achieve a seamless and elegant finish on marble tile installations.</p>', 'a:0:{}', 'uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000058/SempUAYJND_20240831191203.png', 'a:4:{i:100;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";i:714;s:6:\"height\";i:714;s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000058/SempUAYJND_20240831191203.png\";}i:75;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:535.5;s:6:\"height\";d:535.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000058/SempUAYJND_20240831191203_75.png\";}i:50;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:357;s:6:\"height\";d:357;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000058/SempUAYJND_20240831191203_50.png\";}i:25;a:3:{s:5:\"width\";d:178.5;s:6:\"height\";d:178.5;s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"uploads/master/product/products/P2425-0000058/SempUAYJND_20240831191203_25.png\";}}', 'Active', 0, '2024-08-28 12:32:14', 'U2023-0000002', '2024-08-31 13:42:52', 'U2024-0001505', NULL, NULL);
